| **$\,{x}_{i}\,$** | $5$ | $8$ | $9$ | $5$ | $6$ |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **$\,{y}_{i}\,$** | $8$ | $9$ | $10$ | $7$ | $9$ |

Calculate ${S}_{xy}.$" :question/worked-solution "Given a set of $n$ paired observations ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}$ and ${y}_{1},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{n},$ ${S}_{xy}$ is the sum of products of the deviations of ${x}_{i}$ and ${y}_{i}$ from their respective means, that is

$$
\begin{aligned}{S}_{xy} & ={\sum }_{i=1}^{n}({x}_{i}-\overset{―}{x})({y}_{i}-\overset{―}{y}).\end{aligned}
$$

First, we calculate the sample means $\overset{―}{x}$ and $\overset{―}{y}:$

$$
\overset{―}{x}=\frac{5+8+9+5+6}{5}=6.6
$$

$$
\overset{―}{y}=\frac{8+9+10+7+9}{5}=8.6
$$

Next, we calculate the differences between the ${x}_{i}$ and $\overset{―}{x}$, ${y}_{i}$ and $\overset{―}{y}$, and their product.

| **$\,{x}_{i}\,$** | $5$ | $8$ | $9$ | $5$ | $6$ |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **$\,{y}_{i}\,$** | $8$ | $9$ | $10$ | $7$ | $9$ |
| **$\,({x}_{i}-\overset{―}{x})\,$** | $-1.6$ | $1.4$ | $2.4$ | $-1.6$ | $-0.6$ |
| **$\,({y}_{i}-\overset{―}{y})\,$** | $-0.6$ | $0.4$ | $1.4$ | $-1.6$ | $0.4$ |
| **$\,({x}_{i}-\overset{―}{x})({y}_{i}-\overset{―}{y})\,$** | $0.96$ | $0.56$ | $3.36$ | $2.56$ | $-0.24$ |

Therefore, ${S}_{xy}$ is

$$
{S}_{xy}=0.96+0.56+3.36+2.56+(-0.24)=7.2.
$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9d05e707-cf16-5915-a547-c70d2c206fee"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9d05e707-cf16-5915-a547-c70d2c206fee" :answer-field/id #uuid "9d05e707-cf16-5915-a547-c70d2c206fee" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-47de3422-ffeb-5a17-b14f-74498ea093ca" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ee5147e7-4d0d-55e3-9a32-5af3e4b874b2" "answer-47de3422-ffeb-5a17-b14f-74498ea093ca" "answer-f1f5c552-e8d5-558d-8758-dda8b1d41492" "answer-d3e6e201-f276-5cd8-881c-e11c2c1e59c2" "answer-7d408cf0-77ba-54f6-afce-3f39ab3ef960"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ee5147e7-4d0d-55e3-9a32-5af3e4b874b2" :answer/id #uuid "ee5147e7-4d0d-55e3-9a32-5af3e4b874b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{S}_{xy}=6.8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-47de3422-ffeb-5a17-b14f-74498ea093ca" :answer/id #uuid "47de3422-ffeb-5a17-b14f-74498ea093ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{S}_{xy}=7.2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f1f5c552-e8d5-558d-8758-dda8b1d41492" :answer/id #uuid "f1f5c552-e8d5-558d-8758-dda8b1d41492" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{S}_{xy}=7.9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d3e6e201-f276-5cd8-881c-e11c2c1e59c2" :answer/id #uuid "d3e6e201-f276-5cd8-881c-e11c2c1e59c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{S}_{xy}=9.0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7d408cf0-77ba-54f6-afce-3f39ab3ef960" :answer/id #uuid "7d408cf0-77ba-54f6-afce-3f39ab3ef960" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{S}_{xy}=9.5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-e546cbd8-6c28-59cf-9108-41c070e316fd" :question/id #uuid "e546cbd8-6c28-59cf-9108-41c070e316fd" :question/math-academy-id "q-251876" :question/problem "Consider the two sets of $7$ paired observations shown in the table below.

