 \newcommand{\coth}{\mathop{\rm coth}\nolimits}$Find a hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the trigonometric identity $1 + \cot^2{x} = \csc^2{x}.$" :question/worked-solution "$\newcommand{\sech}{\mathop{\rm sech}\nolimits}
