\begin{aligned}{\sum }_{j=1}^{n}f({x}_{j})Δx & ={\sum }_{j=1}^{n}f(a+jΔx)Δx \\  & ={\sum }_{j=1}^{n}[f(0+j\cdot \frac{3}{n})\cdot \frac{3}{n}] \\  & ={\sum }_{j=1}^{n}[f(\frac{3j}{n})\cdot \frac{3}{n}] \\  & ={\sum }_{j=1}^{n}[\frac{3}{n}\operatorname{sin}⁡(\frac{3j}{n})].\end{aligned}
$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4a1a980a-9817-5cc2-b963-bee9f053f5b9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4a1a980a-9817-5cc2-b963-bee9f053f5b9" :answer-field/id #uuid "4a1a980a-9817-5cc2-b963-bee9f053f5b9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-242d5a8d-320a-55dd-af45-50bb63662fa4" :answer-field/choices ["answer-16912225-3f70-5541-b574-3061e2e7b38e" "answer-761dcd9a-706c-5db6-a6b8-883ea8047a63" "answer-9b62e5a4-9e97-5400-851f-d6ea027be307" "answer-242d5a8d-320a-55dd-af45-50bb63662fa4" "answer-e1d1bf4f-0539-5436-aeaf-4b61a267639b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-16912225-3f70-5541-b574-3061e2e7b38e" :answer/id #uuid "16912225-3f70-5541-b574-3061e2e7b38e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\sum }_{j=0}^{n}\operatorname{sin}⁡(\frac{j\pi }{3n})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-761dcd9a-706c-5db6-a6b8-883ea8047a63" :answer/id #uuid "761dcd9a-706c-5db6-a6b8-883ea8047a63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\sum }_{j=1}^{n-1}\operatorname{sin}⁡(\frac{3j}{n})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9b62e5a4-9e97-5400-851f-d6ea027be307" :answer/id #uuid "9b62e5a4-9e97-5400-851f-d6ea027be307" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\sum }_{j=1}^{n}[\frac{2}{n}\operatorname{sin}⁡(\frac{2j}{n})]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-242d5a8d-320a-55dd-af45-50bb63662fa4" :answer/id #uuid "242d5a8d-320a-55dd-af45-50bb63662fa4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\sum }_{j=1}^{n}[\frac{3}{n}\operatorname{sin}⁡(\frac{3j}{n})]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e1d1bf4f-0539-5436-aeaf-4b61a267639b" :answer/id #uuid "e1d1bf4f-0539-5436-aeaf-4b61a267639b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\operatorname{sin}⁡(\frac{j}{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186096850 :activity/expected-seconds 840.0 :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id 17592186162096 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-b9e3535a-6a10-557b-a90a-dcbee5f059a0" "question-6a4bb009-1382-5d80-b122-5cf6749f1552"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-b9e3535a-6a10-557b-a90a-dcbee5f059a0" :question/id #uuid "b9e3535a-6a10-557b-a90a-dcbee5f059a0" :question/math-academy-id "q-138608" :question/problem "$$
X=[\begin{aligned}2 & -2 & 3 \\ 7 & 5 & 9\end{aligned}]
$$

Consider the observation matrix $X$ above, where the individual observations are given in columns. Find the mean-deviation form of $X.$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the mean-deviation form of the observation matrix

$$
X=[\begin{aligned}| & | &  & | \\ {x}_{1} & {x}_{2} & ⋯ & {x}_{n} \\ | & | &  & |\end{aligned}]
$$

is given by 

$$
B=[\begin{aligned}| & | &  & | \\ {b}_{1} & {b}_{2} & ⋯ & {b}_{n} \\ | & | &  & |\end{aligned}]
$$

where ${b}_{i}={x}_{i}-m$ for $i=1,2,…,n,$ and $m$ is sample mean vector.

From the matrix, we have that  

$$
{x}_{1}=[\begin{aligned}2 \\ 7\end{aligned}],\,{x}_{2}=[\begin{aligned}-2 \\ 5\end{aligned}],\,{x}_{3}=[\begin{aligned}3 \\ 9\end{aligned}].
$$

As a result, the sample mean is

$$
\begin{aligned}m & =\frac{1}{3}({x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}) \\  & =\frac{1}{3}([\begin{aligned}2 \\ 7\end{aligned}]+[\begin{aligned}-2 \\ 5\end{aligned}]+[\begin{aligned}3 \\ 9\end{aligned}]) \\  & =\frac{1}{3}[\begin{aligned}3 \\ 21\end{aligned}] \\  & =[\begin{aligned}1 \\ 7\end{aligned}].\end{aligned}
$$

Now, we have the following:

$$
\begin{aligned}{b}_{1} & ={x}_{1}-m=[\begin{aligned}2 \\ 7\end{aligned}]-[\begin{aligned}1 \\ 7\end{aligned}]=[\begin{aligned}1 \\ 0\end{aligned}] \\ {b}_{2} & ={x}_{2}-m=[\begin{aligned}-2 \\ 5\end{aligned}]-[\begin{aligned}1 \\ 7\end{aligned}]=[\begin{aligned}-3 \\ -2\end{aligned}] \\ {b}_{3} & ={x}_{3}-m=[\begin{aligned}3 \\ 9\end{aligned}]-[\begin{aligned}1 \\ 7\end{aligned}]=[\begin{aligned}2 \\ 2\end{aligned}]\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore,  the mean-deviation form is

$$
B=[\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 \\ 0 & -2 & 2\end{aligned}].
$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9980a067-163c-5305-b9d5-aeb44a51e2ee"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9980a067-163c-5305-b9d5-aeb44a51e2ee" :answer-field/id #uuid "9980a067-163c-5305-b9d5-aeb44a51e2ee" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-ad6e45b4-0d19-5a65-9da0-878c4f37d052" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4e278261-12a2-522a-865f-2ee4f991690d" "answer-95c87fe0-b27d-523b-b97f-283a3892f373" "answer-c4625cbc-5b19-59bd-9eb5-2085cc809466" "answer-ad6e45b4-0d19-5a65-9da0-878c4f37d052" "answer-c24f6fe3-8f3b-5e4f-87ee-cd603ef7bb00"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4e278261-12a2-522a-865f-2ee4f991690d" :answer/id #uuid "4e278261-12a2-522a-865f-2ee4f991690d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\begin{aligned}-1 & -1 & 2 \\ 0 & -2 & 2\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-95c87fe0-b27d-523b-b97f-283a3892f373" :answer/id #uuid "95c87fe0-b27d-523b-b97f-283a3892f373" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\begin{aligned}0 & -3 & 2 \\ 1 & 2 & 2\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c4625cbc-5b19-59bd-9eb5-2085cc809466" :answer/id #uuid "c4625cbc-5b19-59bd-9eb5-2085cc809466" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & -2 \\ 0 & -2 & 2\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ad6e45b4-0d19-5a65-9da0-878c4f37d052" :answer/id #uuid "ad6e45b4-0d19-5a65-9da0-878c4f37d052" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 \\ 0 & -2 & 2\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c24f6fe3-8f3b-5e4f-87ee-cd603ef7bb00" :answer/id #uuid "c24f6fe3-8f3b-5e4f-87ee-cd603ef7bb00" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 2 \\ 0 & 0 & -2\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-6a4bb009-1382-5d80-b122-5cf6749f1552" :question