Which of the following statements are true regarding the kite above?

I. $AB=AD.$

II. The kite has a pair of congruent opposite angles.

III. $AB=BC=CD=AD.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's look at each statement in turn.

- Statement I is true. A kite is a quadrilateral with two pairs of congruent sides that are adjacent to each other. In the figure, we can see that $AB=AD.$

- Statement II is true. A kite always has a pair of congruent opposite angles.

- Statement III is false. A kite is a quadrilateral with two pairs of congruent sides that are adjacent to each other. However, not all sides are congruent, for instance, $AB\ne BC.$

In conclusion, statements I and II are true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6a514638-3f19-527b-a1de-1e926b7c8285"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6a514638-3f19-527b-a1de-1e926b7c8285" :answer-field/id #uuid "6a514638-3f19-527b-a1de-1e926b7c8285" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8d7da163-a580-5e50-a38f-f8e138ef74c7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-8d7da163-a580-5e50-a38f-f8e138ef74c7" "answer-edec2c50-c3f2-5ae9-9a96-0ba69435f615" "answer-24387f91-25bf-5714-8675-ef415eba960e" "answer-f02da5b5-90ef-5511-90c7-04d4ca4bf833" "answer-28dbcf41-1538-5429-b8d5-50fbfa182de1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8d7da163-a580-5e50-a38f-f8e138ef74c7" :answer/id #uuid "8d7da163-a580-5e50-a38f-f8e138ef74c7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-edec2c50-c3f2-5ae9-9a96-0ba69435f615" :answer/id #uuid "edec2c50-c3f2-5ae9-9a96-0ba69435f615" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-24387f91-25bf-5714-8675-ef415eba960e" :answer/id #uuid "24387f91-25bf-5714-8675-ef415eba960e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f02da5b5-90ef-5511-90c7-04d4ca4bf833" :answer/id #uuid "f02da5b5-90ef-5511-90c7-04d4ca4bf833" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-28dbcf41-1538-5429-b8d5-50fbfa182de1" :answer/id #uuid "28dbcf41-1538-5429-b8d5-50fbfa182de1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-55788c3c-c1d0-5ef8-8ff4-5e5fd3b4c618" :question/id #uuid "55788c3c-c1d0-5ef8-8ff4-5e5fd3b4c618" :question/math-academy-id "q-53012" :question/problem "![](images/4e/4e20dca5a916c43e93dd94b92ff4c1949a111537a8cb2e45b9ca0be7