$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-057a26a6-55af-55a3-897b-914138a1eb9b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-057a26a6-55af-55a3-897b-914138a1eb9b" :answer-field/id #uuid "057a26a6-55af-55a3-897b-914138a1eb9b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-7d93b2a2-ea70-5d27-a06b-2eb1b0c174f5" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ecacd70a-0d41-5ace-a88e-64b07dd6c585" "answer-cc660814-0552-58be-a5ff-bf43da8972f5" "answer-7d93b2a2-ea70-5d27-a06b-2eb1b0c174f5" "answer-48caa462-32f1-501c-83c0-0379aaf59677" "answer-6c04b536-8c47-5b60-84d0-ad4f649d58d1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ecacd70a-0d41-5ace-a88e-64b07dd6c585" :answer/id #uuid "ecacd70a-0d41-5ace-a88e-64b07dd6c585" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{n\to \infty }{\sum }_{j=0}^{n-1}[2(2+\frac{3j}{n})\cdot \frac{3}{n}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cc660814-0552-58be-a5ff-bf43da8972f5" :answer/id #uuid "cc660814-0552-58be-a5ff-bf43da8972f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{n\to \infty }{\sum }_{j=0}^{n-1}[2{(2+\frac{2j}{n})}^{1/3}\cdot \frac{2}{n}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7d93b2a2-ea70-5d27-a06b-2eb1b0c174f5" :answer/id #uuid "7d93b2a2-ea70-5d27-a06b-2eb1b0c174f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{n\to \infty }{\sum }_{j=0}^{n-1}[2{(2+\frac{3j}{n})}^{1/3}\cdot \frac{3}{n}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-48caa462-32f1-501c-83c0-0379aaf59677" :answer/id #uuid "48caa462-32f1-501c-83c0-0379aaf59677" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{n\to \infty }{\sum }_{j=0}^{n-1}[2{(\frac{3j}{n})}^{1/3}\cdot \frac{3}{n}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6c04b536-8c47-5b60-84d0-ad4f649d58d1" :answer/id #uuid "6c04b536-8c47-5b60-84d0-ad4f649d58d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{n\to \infty }{\sum }_{j=0}^{n-1}[{(3+\frac{3j}{n})}^{1/3}\cdot \frac{3}{n}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186319081 :question/worked-solution "A definite integral can be defined as the limit of a left Riemann sum as follows:

$$
{\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\,\text{d}x={lim}_{n\to \infty }{\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}f({x}_{k})\cdot Δx
$$

where $Δx=\frac{b-a}{n}$ and ${x}_{k}=a+kΔx.$

Notice that we're given that the lower limit $a=-1.$ 

Comparing the given summation with the general expression above, we see that $Δx=\frac{3}{n}.$ Therefore, 

$$
\frac{3}{n}=\frac{b-(-1)}{n}\,⟹\,b=2.
$$

Consequently, ${x}_{k}=-1+\frac{3k}{n}$ and $f({x}_{k})=({x}_{k}+8)^{1/3}.$

Hence,

$$
{\int }_{-1}^{2}(x+8)^{1/3}\,\text{d}x={lim}_{n\to \infty }{\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}[{((-1+\frac{3k}{n})+8)}^{1/3}\cdot \frac{3}{n}].
$$

Therefore, the correct answer is 

