$$

From the matrix above, we see that the pivot columns are the $1$st, $2$nd, and $4$th columns. So, a basis of $\text{Col}(Q)$ is $\{{q}_{1},{q}_{2},{q}_{4}\}.$ 

So, we conclude that $B=\{{q}_{1},{q}_{4}\}$ is not a basis of $\text{Col}(Q).$"] ["question-599b6849-3342-5594-bc18-d66421f45e91" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-2cf517a6-abf9-5b4f-942e-0933e5866f68" :answer-field/id #uuid "2cf517a6-abf9-5b4f-942e-0933e5866f68"] ["answer-0dee10fc-3dcb-5237-af24-246152c9267c" :answer/id #uuid "0dee10fc-3dcb-5237-af24-246152c9267c"] ["answer-0dee10fc-3dcb-5237-af24-246152c9267c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0dee10fc-3dcb-5237-af24-246152c9267c" :answer/value "-6"] ["answer-3f53ddd2-bec1-5acd-9379-2bb08043f9b8" :answer/id #uuid "3f53ddd2-bec1-5acd-9379-2bb08043f9b8"] ["answer-3f53ddd2-bec1-5acd-9379-2bb08043f9b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3f53ddd2-bec1-5acd-9379-2bb08043f9b8" :answer/value "-8"] ["answer-1e13e6c1-1f37-56f8-a726-2aee62b71439" :answer/id #uuid "1e13e6c1-1f37-56f8-a726-2aee62b71439"] ["answer-1e13e6c1-1f37-56f8-a726-2aee62b71439" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-1e13e6c1-1f37-56f8-a726-2aee62b71439" :answer/value "12"] ["answer-8e0920b1-977a-544d-8f3c-6269c1d5b48c" :answer/id #uuid "8e0920b1-977a-544d-8f3c-6269c1d5b48c"] ["answer-8e0920b1-977a-544d-8f3c-6269c1d5b48c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-8e0920b1-977a-544d-8f3c-6269c1d5b48c" :answer/value "9"] ["answer-3bb4d8dd-5f42-53d6-b9ea-b3eb6b57a83a" :answer/id #uuid "3bb4d8dd-5f42-53d6-b9ea-b3eb6b57a83a"] ["answer-3bb4d8dd-5f42-53d6-b9ea-b3eb6b57a83a" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-3bb4d8dd-5f42-53d6-b9ea-b3eb6b57a83a" :answer/value "$\{{q}_{1},{q}_{4}\}$ is not a basis of $\text{Col}(Q)$"] ["answer-field-2cf517a6-abf9-5b4f-942e-0933e5866f68" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-2cf517a6-abf9-5b4f-942e-0933e5866f68" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-2cf517a6-abf9-5b4f-942e-0933e5866f68" :answer-field/correct "answer-3bb4d8dd-5f42-53d6-b9ea-b3eb6b57a83a"] ["answer-field-2cf517a6-abf9-5b4f-942e-0933e5866f68" :answer-field/choices "answer-0dee10fc-3dcb-52