Find a hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the trigonometric identity $\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=2\operatorname{sin}⁡x\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$"] [17592186167465 :question/worked-solution "$$

Osborn's rule allows us to construct a hyperbolic identity from a corresponding trigonometric identity.

To apply Osborn's rule, we follow two steps:

1\. Replace every trigonometric function with its corresponding hyperbolic function.

2\. For any product of two trigonometric sines, flip the sign of the corresponding product of hyperbolic sines.

We're given the following trigonometric identity:

$$
\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=2\operatorname{sin}⁡x\operatorname{cos}⁡x
$$

Notice that we do not have a product of sines. Therefore, the corresponding hyperbolic identity is 

$$
\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x=2\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\operatorname{cosh}⁡x.
$$"] [17592186167465 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-4f9358f5-ef1f-54b1-99ef-1197f59d64d0" :answer/id #uuid "4f9358f5-ef1f-54b1-99ef-1197f59d64d0"] ["answer-4f9358f5-ef1f-54b1-99ef-1197f59d64d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4f9358f5-ef1f-54b1-99ef-1197f59d64d0" :answer/value "\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x=-2\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\operatorname{cosh}⁡x"] ["answer-81cbace4-5806-5b41-b4de-0e5c8bcb22b2" :answer/id #uuid "81cbace4-5806-5b41-b4de-0e5c8bcb22b2"] ["answer-81cbace4-5806-5b41-b4de-0e5c8bcb22b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-81cbace4-5806-5b41-b4de-0e5c8bcb22b2" :answer/value "\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x=2\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\operatorname{cosh}⁡x"] ["answer-81e96895-4bc5-5473-8e80-cdb7431151cd" :answer/id #uuid "81e96895-4bc5-5473-8e80-cdb7431151cd"] ["answer-81e96895-4bc5-5473-8e80-cdb7431151cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-81e96895-4bc5-5473-8e80-cdb7431151cd" :answer/value "\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x=\frac{1}{2}\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\operatorname{cosh}⁡x"] ["answer-2fb53bbb-85a3-5bf3-a469-97f9b6d515c2" :answer/id #uuid "2fb53bbb-85a3-5bf3-a469-97f9b6d515c2"] ["answer-2fb53bbb-85a3-5bf3-a469-97f9b6d515c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2fb53bbb-85a3-5bf3-a469-97f9b6d515c2" :answer/value "\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x={sinh}^{2}⁡x+{cosh}^{2}⁡x"] ["answer-c9355724-e50d-561b-a5bc-0428aabebe3e" :answer/id #uuid "c9355724-e50d-561b-a5bc-0428aabebe3e"] ["answer-c9355724-e50d-561b-a5bc-0428aabebe3e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c9355724-e50d-561b-a5bc-0428aabebe3e" :answer/value "\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x={sinh}^{2}⁡x-{cosh}^{2}⁡x"] [17592186165998 :answer-field/correct "answer-81cbace4-5806-5b41-b4de-0e5c8bcb22b2"] [17592186165998 :answer-field/choices "answer-4f9358f5-ef1f-54b1-99ef-1197f59d64d0"] [17592186165998 :answer-field/choices "answer-81cbace4-5806-5b41-b4de-0e5c8bcb22b2"] [17592186165998 :answer-field/choices "answer-81e96895-4bc5-5473-8e80-cdb7431151cd"] [17592186165998 :answer-field/choices "answer-