{{field-1}}"] ["question-f7758d7e-a5ba-50ee-a45d-ff68b3cc6226" :question/worked-solution "$$

First, we find the hyperbolic identities that correspond to the following trigonometric identities:

$$
\operatorname{cot}⁡x=\frac{\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\operatorname{sin}⁡x},\,\operatorname{csc}⁡x=\frac{1}{\operatorname{sin}⁡x}
$$

Using Osborn's rule, the corresponding hyperbolic identities are

$$
\operatorname{coth}⁡x=\frac{\operatorname{cosh}⁡x}{\operatorname{sinh}⁡x},\,\operatorname{csch}⁡x=\frac{1}{\operatorname{sinh}⁡x}.
$$

Now, we rewrite the integral as follows:

$$
\begin{aligned}{\int }_{0}^{\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\frac{\operatorname{coth}⁡x}{{csch}^{2}⁡x}\,\text{d}x & ={\int }_{0}^{\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\operatorname{coth}⁡x\cdot \frac{1}{{csch}^{2}⁡x}\,\text{d}x \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\frac{\operatorname{cosh}⁡x}{\operatorname{sinh}⁡x}\cdot {sinh}^{2}⁡x\,\text{d}x \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\,\text{d}x\end{aligned}
$$

We can solve this by substitution. Let $u=\operatorname{cosh}⁡x.$ Then,

$$
\frac{\text{d}u}{\text{d}x}=\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\,⟹\,\text{d}u=\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\,\text{d}x.
$$

Now, we fill the table for the limits of integration, according to the rule $u=\operatorname{cosh}⁡x.$

| $x$ | $0$ | $\operatorname{ln}⁡3$ |
| --- | --- | --- |
| $u$ | $1$ | $\frac{5}{3}$ |

Now, we evaluate the integral as follows:

$$
\begin{aligned}\begin{aligned}{\int }_{0}^{\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\,\text{d}x & ={\int }_{1}^{5/3}u\,\cdot \text{d}u \\  & =\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}{|}_{1}^{5/3} \\  & =\frac{1}{2}({(\frac{5}{3})}^{2}-{1}^{2}) \\  & =\frac{1}{2}(\frac{25}{9}-1) \\  & =\frac{8}{9}\end{aligned}\end{aligned}
$$"] ["question-f7758d7e-a5ba-50ee-a45d-ff68b3cc6226" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-4af736d1-f000-5f15-b738-443b7520d5c7" :answer-field/id #uuid "4af736d1-f000-5f15-b738-443b7520d5c7"] ["answer-2a2b669f-2579-5335-819c-e77eab944787" :answer/id #uuid "2a2b669f-2579-5335-819c-e77eab944787"] ["answer-2a2b669f-2579-5335-819c-e77eab944787" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2a2b669f-2579-5335-819c-e77eab944787" :answer/value "\frac{8}{9}"] ["answer-field-4af736d1-f000-5f15-b738-443b7520d5c7" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-4af736d1-f000-5f15-b738-443b7520d5c7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-4af736d1-f000-5f15-b738-443b7520d5c7" :answer-field/correct "answer-2a2b669f-2579-5335-819c-e77eab944787"] ["answer-field-4af736d1-f000-5f15-b738-443b7520d5c7" :answer-field/choices "answer-2a2b669f-2579-5335-819c-e77eab944787"] ["question-f7758d7e-a5ba-50ee-a45d-ff68b3cc6226" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-4af736d1-f000-5f15-b738-443b7520d5c7"] [17592186166793 :knowledge-point/questions "question-f7758d7e-a5ba-50ee-a45d-ff68b3cc6226"] ["question-7d070173-586a-5be7-bd5c-a4be4b18eeea" :question/id #uuid "7d070173-586a-5be7-bd5c-a4be4b18eeea"] ["question-7d070173-586a-5be7-bd5c-a4be4b18eeea" :question/math-academy-id "q-352966"] ["question-7d070173-586a-5be7-bd5c-a4be4b18eeea" :question/problem "$$

