wer-field-bc9bd1b9-0131-55b4-a33d-f2d8e3052b46" :answer-field/choices "answer-4b45565c-a329-5dbb-9963-42bd3aefa10e"] ["answer-field-bc9bd1b9-0131-55b4-a33d-f2d8e3052b46" :answer-field/choices "answer-c55f0115-e6bf-5e7b-88ff-bcccaff67b54"] ["answer-field-bc9bd1b9-0131-55b4-a33d-f2d8e3052b46" :answer-field/choices "answer-db7af467-35db-5c13-913d-0211eaf4b4c3"] ["answer-field-bc9bd1b9-0131-55b4-a33d-f2d8e3052b46" :answer-field/choices "answer-489e5d74-a352-5e41-872e-d97d1152340f"] ["question-ac3e396f-e9ff-515e-95c3-ddf87162b016" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-bc9bd1b9-0131-55b4-a33d-f2d8e3052b46"] [17592186096677 :knowledge-point/questions "question-ac3e396f-e9ff-515e-95c3-ddf87162b016"] ["question-2b21718f-1527-5624-995c-489290485c6f" :question/id #uuid "2b21718f-1527-5624-995c-489290485c6f"] ["question-2b21718f-1527-5624-995c-489290485c6f" :question/math-academy-id "q-128027"] ["question-2b21718f-1527-5624-995c-489290485c6f" :question/problem "Find the value of $(-\frac{12}{5})÷(-3).$"] ["question-2b21718f-1527-5624-995c-489290485c6f" :question/worked-solution "Dividing a negative number by a negative number gives a positive number. Hence, the result will be positive.

Therefore, since 

$$
\frac{12}{5}÷3=\frac{12}{5\times 3}=\frac{12}{15}=\frac{4}{5},
$$

we obtain

$$
(-\frac{12}{5})÷(-3)=\frac{4}{5}.
$$"] ["question-2b21718f-1527-5624-995c-489290485c6f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-4b9b6de2-c942-5b7d-bee5-f32a9154bfcb" :answer-field/id #uuid "4b9b6de2-c942-5b7d-bee5-f32a9154bfcb"] ["answer-92639e1b-9c28-54c1-b941-f73ffe10bfb2" :answer/id #uuid "92639e1b-9c28-54c1-b941-f73ffe10bfb2"] ["answer-92639e1b-9c28-54c1-b941-f73ffe10bfb2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-92639e1b-9c28-54c1-b941-f73ffe10bfb2" :answer/value "-\frac{4}{5}"] ["answer-ae9d109d-0856-50b3-91be-dcbd5c513945" :answer/id #uuid "ae9d109d-0856-50b3-91be-dcbd5c513945"] ["answer-ae9d109d-0856-50b3-91be-dcbd5c513945" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ae9d109d-0856-50b3-91be-dcbd5c513945" :answer/value "-\frac{5}{3}"] ["answer-cb0bbf4b-84c5-5b4b-bf9f-be7a1d428368" :answer/id #uuid "cb0bbf4b-84c5-5b4b-bf9f-be7a1d428368"] ["answer-cb0bbf4b-84c5-5b4b-bf9f-be7a1d428368" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-cb0bbf4b-84c5-5b4b-bf9f-be7a1d428368" :answer/value "\frac{3}{4}"] ["answer-31fe9d50-00ed-566e-af8a-d1bb3e363580" :answer/id #uuid "31fe9d50-00ed-566e-af8a-d1bb3e363580"] ["answer-31fe9d50-00ed-566e-af8a-d1bb3e363580" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-31fe9d50-00ed-566e-af8a-d1bb3e363580" :answer/value "\frac{4}{5}"] ["answer-055df541-ba49-5b08-8eb5-364df6d7f59e" :answer/id #uuid "055df541-ba49-5b08-8eb5-364df6d7f59e"] ["answer-055df541-ba49-5b08-8eb5-364df6d7f59e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-055df541-ba49-5b08-8eb5-364df6d7f59e" :answer/value "\frac{5}{3}"] ["answer-field-4b9b6de2-c942-5b7d-bee5-f32a9154bfcb" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-4b9b6de2-c942-5b7d-bee5-f32a9154bfcb" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-4b9b6de2-c942-5b7d-bee5-f32a9154bfcb" :answer-field/correct "answer-31fe9d50-00ed-566e-af8a-d1bb3e363580"] ["answer-field-4b9b6de2-c942-5b7d-bee5-f32a9154bfcb" :answer-field/choices "answer-92639e1b-9c28-54c1-b941-f73ffe10bfb2"] ["answer-field-4b9b6de2-c942-5b7d-bee5-f32a9154bfcb" :answer-field/choices "answer-ae9d109d-0856-50b3-91be-dcbd5c513945"] ["answer-field-4b9b6de2-c942-5b7d-bee5-f32a9154bfcb" :answer-field/choices "answer-cb0bbf4b-84c5-5b4b-bf9f-be7a1d428368"] ["answer-field-4b9b6de2-c942-5b7d-bee5-f32a9154bfcb" :answer-field/choices "answer-31fe9d50-00ed-566e-af8a-d1bb3e363580"] ["answer-field-4b9b6de2-c942-5b7d-bee5-f32a9154bfcb" :answer-field/choices "answer-055df541-ba49-5b08-8eb5-364df6d7f59e"] ["question-2b21718f-1527-5624-995c-489290485c6f" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-4b9b6de2-c942-5b7d-bee5-f32a9154bfcb"] [17592186179799 :knowledge-point/questions "question-2b21718f-1527-5624-995c-489290485c6f"] ["question-d513115b-ad74-5e72-8ee2-71bd9f120a6f" :question/id #uuid "d513115b-ad74-5e72-8ee2-71bd9f120a6f"] ["question-d513115b-ad74-5e72-8ee2-71bd9f120a6f" :question/math-academy-id "q-128174"] ["question-d513115b-ad74-5e72-8ee2-71bd9f120a6f" :question/problem "![](images/0f/0f18036ac5790bda530116c6847243108f9617f9ae12fcbc5c1b2c3fff018985.png)

Which of the following terms describe the shape above?

I. Parallelogram

II. Rectangle

III. Rhombus"] ["question-d513115b-ad74-5e72-8ee2-71bd9f120a6f" :question/worked-solution "First, recall the hierarchy diagram of quadrilaterals, where each shape below another is a specific type of the one above it.

![](images/1d/1dbe4c3e8ea97c0ac077c37143802366c5817d86965ab1dbc5abf54cd01d27c3.png)

Let's now look at the terms one by one.

- The given figure is a quadrilateral with two pairs of opposite congruent sides, so it is a parallelogram.

- Since the four angles of the quadrilateral are right angles, it is a rectangle.

- The given figure is a quadrilateral where the sides are not all congruent. So it is **not** a rhombus.

Consequently, the given shape is described by terms I (parallelogram), and II (rectangle)."] ["question-d513115b-ad74-5e72-8ee2-71bd9f120a6f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-27071654-a089-55fa-816c-6ef4bea74f2e" :answer-field/id #uuid "27071654-a089-55fa-816c-6ef4bea74f2e"] ["answer-756c1651-49c5-59b4-9237-64c638bfd4f1" :answer/id #uuid "756c1651-49c5-59b4-9237-64c638bfd4f1"] ["answer-756c1651-49c5-59b4-9237-64c638bfd4f1" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-756c1651-49c5-59b4-9237-64c638bfd4f1" :answer/value "I and II only"] ["answer-0099a153-14ac-5228-adff-948144c7c511" :answer/id #uuid "0099a153-14ac-5228-adff-948144c7c511"] ["answer-0099a153-14ac-5228-adff-948144c7c511" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-0099a153-14ac-5228-adff-948144c7c511" :answer/value "I only"] ["answer-164cdbc6-b14e-5459-8e4d-4f24d14ceda3" :answer/id #uuid "164cdbc6-b14e-5459-8e4d-4f24d14ceda3"] ["answer-164cdbc6-b14e-5459-8e4d-4f24d14ceda3" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-164cdbc6-b14e-5459-8e4d-4f24d14ceda3" :answer/value "II and III only"] ["answer-eb7b757c-1895-5c25-80ab-64cfd132b5b7" :answer/id #uuid "eb7b757c-1895-5c25-80ab-64cfd132b5b7"] ["answer-eb7b757c-1895-5c25-80ab-64cfd132b5b7" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-eb7b757c-1895-5c25-80ab-64cfd132b5b7" :answer/value "II only"] ["answer-19ac550c-b465-5b11-ae37-62b736f5ff29" :answer/id #uuid "19ac550c-b465-5b11-ae37-62b736f5ff29"] ["answer-19ac550c-b465-5b11-ae37-62b736f5ff29" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-19ac550c-b465-5b11-ae37-62b736f5ff29" :answer/value "III only"] ["answer-field-27071654-a089-55fa-816c-6ef4bea74f2e" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-27071654-a089-55fa-816c-6ef4bea74f2e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-27071654-a089-55fa-816c-6ef4bea74f2e" :answer-field/correct "answer-756c1651-49c5-59b4-9237-64c638bfd4f1"] ["answer-field-27071654-a089-55fa-816c-6ef4bea74f2e" :answer-field/choices "answer-756c1651-49c5-59b4