$y$"] ["question-8e8a0eda-6609-511f-9732-1a6312007048" :question/worked-solution "We collect and combine the like terms, simplifying the coefficients as much as possible:

$$
\begin{aligned}\frac{2}{5}x+4y+\frac{5}{2}x+3y & = \\ (\frac{2}{5}x+\frac{5}{2}x)+(4y+3y) & = \\ (\frac{2}{5}+\frac{5}{2})x+(4+3)y & = \\ (\frac{4}{10}+\frac{25}{10})x+7y & = \\ (\frac{4+25}{10})x+7y & = \\ \frac{29}{10}\,x+7\,y\end{aligned}
$$"] ["question-8e8a0eda-6609-511f-9732-1a6312007048" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-cebc456f-ee3c-58cf-96e7-c237efa764f7" :answer-field/id #uuid "cebc456f-ee3c-58cf-96e7-c237efa764f7"] ["answer-6ee09fa0-6224-5178-b8f9-36c108594771" :answer/id #uuid "6ee09fa0-6224-5178-b8f9-36c108594771"] ["answer-6ee09fa0-6224-5178-b8f9-36c108594771" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6ee09fa0-6224-5178-b8f9-36c108594771" :answer/value "\frac{29}{10}"] ["answer-field-cebc456f-ee3c-58cf-96e7-c237efa764f7" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-cebc456f-ee3c-58cf-96e7-c237efa764f7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-cebc456f-ee3c-58cf-96e7-c237efa764f7" :answer-field/correct "answer-6ee09fa0-6224-5178-b8f9-36c108594771"] ["answer-field-cebc456f-ee3c-58cf-96e7-c237efa764f7" :answer-field/choices "answer-6ee09fa0-6224-5178-b8f9-36c108594771"] ["answer-field-aa265d47-40f3-5a3f-9bf0-25685f2be3fa" :answer-field/id #uuid "aa265d47-40f3-5a3f-9bf0-25685f2be3fa"] ["answer-7dda24c2-846e-5ae5-9e55-258b14393706" :answer/id #uuid "7dda24c2-846e-5ae5-9e55-258b14393706"] ["answer-7dda24c2-846e-5ae5-9e55-258b14393706" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-7dda24c2-846e-5ae5-9e55-258b14393706" :answer/value "7"] ["answer-field-aa265d47-40f3-5a3f-9bf0-25685f2be3fa" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-aa265d47-40f3-5a3f-9bf0-25685f2be3fa" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-aa265d47-40f3-5a3f-9bf0-25685f2be3fa" :answer-field/correct "answer-7dda24c2-846e-5ae5-9e55-258b14393706"] ["answer-field-aa265d47-40f3-5a3f-9bf0-25685f2be3fa" :answer-field/choices "answer-7dda24c2-846e-5ae5-9e55-258b14393706"] ["question-8e8a0eda-6609-511f-9732-1a6312007048" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-cebc456f-ee3c-58cf-96e7-c237efa764f7"] ["question-8e8a0eda-6609-511f-9732-1a6312007048" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-aa265d47-40f3-5a3f-9bf0-25685f2be3fa"] [17592186138511 :knowledge-point/questions "question-8e8a0eda-6609-511f-9732-1a6312007048"] ["question-f3e4db00-9ed0-5e91-8213-2ca14aefffbb" :question/id #uuid "f3e4db00-9ed0-5e91-8213-2ca14aefffbb"] ["question-f3e4db00-9ed0-5e91-8213-2ca14aefffbb" :question/math-academy-id "q-103625"] ["question-f3e4db00-9ed0-5e91-8213-2ca14aefffbb" :question/problem "If $\frac{5x-10y-2z}{5}$ is written in the form $ax+by+cz,$ what are the values of  $a,$ $b$ and $c?$"] ["question-f3e4db00-9ed0-5e91-8213-2ca14aefffbb" :question/worked-solution "Splitting the fraction into separate terms and then simplifying the fractions in the individual terms, we get

$$
\begin{aligned}\frac{5x-10y-2z}{5} & = \\ \frac{5x}{5}-\frac{10y}{5}-\frac{2z}{5} & = \\ \frac{5}{5}\cdot x-\frac{10}{5}\cdot y-\frac{2}{5}\cdot z & = \\ 1\cdot x-2\cdot y-\frac{2}{5}\cdot z & = \\ x-2y-\frac{2z}{5} & .\end{aligned}
$$

Writing the above in the form $ax+by+cz,$ we get

$$
\begin{aligned}{{(1)}_{⏟}}_{a}x+{{(-2)}_{⏟}}_{b}y+{{(-\frac{2}{5})}_{⏟}}_{c}z.\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore,  $a=1,$ $b=-2$ and $c=-\frac{2}{5}.$"] ["question-f3e4db00-9ed0-5e91-8213-2ca14aefffbb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-9ac144df-2131-57c9-bfbb-43bd44e355e9" :answer-field/id #uuid "9ac144df-2131-57c9-bfbb-43bd44e355e9"] ["answer-fc3e3b6b-5c5d-5998-9365-602913fed818" :answer/id #uuid "fc3e3b6b-5c5d-5998-9365-602913fed818"] ["answer-fc3e3b6b-5c5d-5998-9365-602913fed818" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-fc3e3b6b-5c5d-5998-9365-602913fed818" :answer/value "$a=1,$ $b=-2$ and $c=-\frac{2}{5}$"] ["answer-86d1e6a6-32cc-5370-9d0c-04db2526ab57" :answer/id #uuid "86d1e6a6-32cc-5370-9d0c-04db2526ab57"] ["answer-86d1e6a6-32cc-5370-9d0c-04db2526ab57" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-86d1e6a6-32cc-5370-9d0c-04db2526ab57" :answer/value "$a=1,$ $b=-2$ and $c=2$"] ["answer-bd7d356d-5fef-5042-be30-4689b4b9777a" :answer/id #uuid "bd7d356d-5fef-5042-be30-4689b4b9777a"] ["answer-bd7d356d-5fef-5042-be30-4689b4b9777a" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-bd7d356d-5fef-5042-be30-4689b4b9777a" :answer/value "$a=1,$ $b=\frac{1}{5}$ and $c=-\frac{2}{5}$"] ["answer-2385595f-7f7d-5bcb-b6db-b0de1f32a65b" :answer/id #uuid "2385595f-7f7d-5bcb-b6db-b0de1f32a65b"] ["answer-2385595f-7f7d-5bcb-b6db-b0de1f32a65b" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-2385595f-7f7d-5bcb-b6db-b0de1f32a65b" :answer/value "$a=2,$ $b=-2$ and $c=-1$"] ["answer-5bd91c40-af18-5c9d-b794-20c583df8cb8" :answer/id #uuid "5bd91c40-af18-5c9d-b794-20c583df8cb8"] ["answer-5bd91c40-af18-5c9d-b794-20c583df8cb8" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-5bd91c40-af18-5c9d-b794-20c583df8cb8" :answer/value "$a=\frac{1}{5},$ $b=2$ and $c=\frac{2}{5}$"] ["answer-field-9ac144df-2131-57c9-bfbb-43bd44e355e9" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-9ac144df-2131-57c9-bfbb-43bd44e355e9" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-9ac144df-2131-57c9-bfbb-43bd44e355e9" :answer-field/correct "answer-fc3e3b6b-5c5d-5998-9365-602913fed818"] ["answer-field-9ac144df-213