III. $\displaystyle\oint_{-C}\mathbf F\cdot \textrm d \mathbf r > 0$"] [17592186179605 :question/problem "Consider the vector field $\mathbf F(x,y) =( e^y+x)\,\mathbf i +(xe^y+y^2)\,\mathbf j.$ Which of the following statements are true?

I. $\mathbf F$ is conservative

II. $\displaystyle\int\limits_C\mathbf F \cdot \textrm d\mathbf r = 0$ for any piecewise-smooth path $C\in\mathbb R^2$

III. $\displaystyle\oint\limits_C\mathbf F \cdot \textrm d\mathbf r =0$ for any closed path $C\in\mathbb R^2$"] ["question-83ed0f7d-e76a-53b6-8cf6-264c24acad16" :question/id #uuid "83ed0f7d-e76a-53b6-8cf6-264c24acad16"] ["question-83ed0f7d-e76a-53b6-8cf6-264c24acad16" :question/math-academy-id "q-73139"] ["question-83ed0f7d-e76a-53b6-8cf6-264c24acad16" :question/problem "![](images/17/17f6b2ab535408802ef2776eea2db41ac20b17f3568e245ee87b13f05767203f.png)

The area under the curve $y=\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}}$ between $x=0$, $x=3$ and the $x$-axis is approximated using a left Riemann sum, as shown above. What is the expression for the Riemann sum in sigma notation?"] ["question-83ed0f7d-e76a-53b6-8cf6-264c24acad16" :question/worked-solution "The left Riemann sum for $y=f(x)$ with a regular step size in sigma notation is

$$
{\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}f({x}_{k})Δx,
$$

where ${x}_{k}=a+kΔx$ with $Δx=\frac{b-a}{n}.$ 

From the diagram, we see that there are $n=3$ rectangles. The endpoints indicate that $a=0$ and $b=3,$ so the step size is

$$
Δx=\frac{3-0}{3}=\frac{3}{3}=1.
$$

Therefore, using sigma notation, the left Riemann sum can be expressed as

$$
\begin{aligned}{\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}f({x}_{k})Δx & ={\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}f(a+kΔx)Δx \\  & ={\sum }_{k=0}^{3-1}f(0+k\cdot 1)\cdot 1 \\  & ={\sum }_{k=0}^{2}f(k) \\  & ={\sum }_{k=0}^{2}\sqrt{9-{k}^{2}}.\end{aligned}
$$"] ["question-83ed0f7d-e76a-53b6-8cf6-264c24acad16" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-61f4da89-3768-5682-9582-88618e04b971" :answer-field/id #uuid "61f4da89-3768-5682-9582-88618e04b971"] ["answer-06c395f8-cf42-52aa-a803-43591ce1552c" :answer/id #uuid "06c395f8-cf42-52aa-a803-43591ce1552c"] ["answer-06c395f8-cf42-52aa-a803-43591ce1552c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-06c395f8-cf42-52aa-a803-43591ce1552c" :answer/value "9{\sum }_{k=0}^{2}\sqrt{1-{k}^{2}}"] ["answer-9d636130-3c2c-52dd-9e9b-3376ca8624c2" :answer/id #uuid "9d636130-3c2c-52dd-9e9b-3376ca8624c2"] ["answer-9d636130-3c2c-52dd-9e9b-3376ca8624c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9d636130-3c2c-52dd-9e9b-3376ca8624c2" :answer/value "{\sum }_{k=0}^{2}\sqrt{8-{k}^{2}-2k}"] ["answer-e2bc2c15-5ae4-5cc7-8401-515b22401c82" :answer/id #uuid "e2bc2c15-5ae4-5cc7-8401-515b22401c82"] ["answer-e2bc2c15-5ae4-5cc7-8401-515b22401c82" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e2bc2c15-5ae4-5cc7-8401-515b22401c82" :answer/value "{\sum }_{k=0}^{2}\sqrt{9-{k}^{2}}"] ["answer-fab745cb-883b-50ae-b463-3c48ccdfe0a3" :answer/id #uuid "fab745cb-883b-50ae-b463-3c48ccdfe0a3"] ["answer-fab745cb-883b-50ae-b463-3c48ccdfe0a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-fab745cb-883b-50ae-b463-3c48ccdfe0a3" :answer/value "{\sum }_{k=0}^{3}\sqrt{6-{k}^{2}}"] ["answer-57c77a3f-a887-515d-9a85-dfc4702748fe" :answer/id #uuid "57c77a3f-a887-515d-9a85-dfc4702748fe"] ["answer-57c77a3f-a887-515d-9a85-dfc4702748fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-57c77a3f-a887-515d-9a85-dfc4702748fe" :answer/value "{\sum }_{k=0}^{3}\sqrt{8-{k}^{2}}"] ["answer-field-61f4da89-3768-5682-9582-88618e04b971" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-61f4da89-3768-5682-9582-88618e04b971" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-61f4da89-3768-5682-9582-88618e04b971" :answer-field/correct "answer-e2bc2c15-5ae4-5cc7-8401-515b22401c82"] ["answer-field-61f4da89-3768-5682-9582-88618e04b971" :answer-field/choices "answer-06c395f8-cf42-52aa-a803-43591ce1552c"] ["answer-field-61f4da89-3768-5682-9582-88618e04b971" :answer-field/choices "answer-9d636130-3c2c-52dd-9e9b-3376ca8624c2"] ["answer-field-61f4da89-3768-5682-9582-88618e04b971" :answer-field/choices "answer-e2bc2c15-5ae4-5cc7-8401-515b22401c82"] ["answer-field-61f4da89-3768-5682-9582-88618e04b971" :answer-field/choices "answer-fab745cb-883b-50ae-b463-3c48ccdfe0a3"] ["answer-field-61f4da89-3768-5682-9582-88618e04b971" :answer-field/choices "answer-57c77a3f-a887-515d-9a85-dfc4702748fe"] ["question-83ed0f7d-e76a-53b6-8cf6-264c24acad16" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-61f4da89-3768-5682-9582-88618e04b971"] [17592186096628 :knowledge-point/questions "question-83ed0f7d-e76a-53b6-8cf6-264c24acad16"] ["question-0a6becce-61cc-5b53-a5ff-f772c9293a84" :question/id #uuid "0a6becce-61cc-5b53-a5ff-f772c9293a84"] ["question-0a6becce-61cc-5b53-a5ff-f772c9293a84" :question/math-academy-id "q-73069"] ["question-0a6becce-61cc-5b53-a5ff-f772c9293a84" :question/problem "The area under the curve $y=2\operatorname{cos}⁡x$ between $x=0$ and $x=\frac{\pi }{2}$ and the $x$-axis is approximated by a left Riemann sum using $4$ subintervals of equal length. What is the expression for the Riemann sum in sigma notation?"] ["question-0a6becce-61cc-5b53-a5ff-f772c9293a84" :question/worked-solution "The left Riemann sum for $y=f(x)$ with a regular step size in sigma notation is

$$
{\sum }_{j=0}^{n-1}f({x}_{j})Δx,
$$

where ${x}_{j}=a+jΔx$ with $Δx=\frac{b-a}{n}.$ 

We're given that $n=4$ subintervals.  The endpoints indicate that $a=0$ and $b=\frac{\pi }{2},$ so the step size is

$$
Δx=\frac{(\frac{\pi }{2}-0)}{4}=\frac{\pi }{8}.
$$

Therefore,  using sigma notation, the left Riemann sum can be expressed as 

$$
\begin{aligned}{\sum }_{j=0}^{n-1}f({x}_{j})Δx & ={\sum }_{j=0}^{n-1}f(a+jΔx)Δx \\  & ={\sum }_{j=0}^{4-1}f(0+j\cdot \frac{\pi }{8})\cdot \frac{\pi }{8} \\  & ={\sum }_{j=0}^{3}f(\frac{j\pi }{8})\cdot \frac{\pi }{8} \\  & ={\sum }_{j=0}^{3}\frac{\pi }{8}\cdot 2\operatorname{cos}⁡(\frac{j\pi }{8}) \\  & =\frac{\pi }{4}{\sum }_{j=0}^{3}\operatorname{cos}⁡(\frac{j\pi }{8}).\end{aligned}
$$"] ["question-0a6becce-61cc-5b53-a5ff-f772c9293a84" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-f9b02b04-3990-5647-8a7e-f4a0b6db0f71" :answer-field/id #uuid "f9b02b04-3990-5647-8a7e-f4a0b6db0f71"] ["answer-4cc7096b-e4d0-5551-8b4c-698c994185de" :answer/id #uuid "4cc7096b-e4d0-5551-8b4c-698c994185de"] ["answer-4cc7096b-e4d0-5551-8b4c-698c994185de" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4cc7096b-e4d0-5551-8b4c-698c994185de" :answer/value "\frac{\pi }{2}{\sum }_{j=0}^{3}\operatorname{cos}⁡(\frac{j\pi }{2})"] ["answer-5479d04f-11d8-52ff-a10f-c5daf44d5b8d" :answer/id #uuid "5479d04f-11d8-52ff-a10f-c5daf44d5b8d"] ["answer-5479d04f-11d8-52ff-a10f-c5daf44d5b8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5479d04f-11d8-52ff-a10f-c5daf44d5b8d" :answer/value "\frac{\pi }{4}{\sum }_{j=0}^{3}\operatorname{cos}⁡(\frac{j\pi }{8})"] ["answer-d48e153e-cc47-599d-abb7-f430aae869da" :answer/id #uuid "d48e153e-cc47-599d-abb7-f430aae869da"] ["answer-d48e153e-cc47-599d-abb7-f430aae869da" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d48e153e-cc47-599d-abb7-f430aae869da" :answer/value "\frac{\pi }{4}{\sum }_{j=1}^{4}\operatorname{cos}⁡(\frac{j\pi }{8})"] ["answer-79aff7b5-6b64-51d5-8c15-e972a08c75b0" :answer/id #uuid "79aff7b5-6b64-51d5-8c15-e972a08c75b0"] ["answer-79aff7b5-6b64-51d5-8c15-e972a08c75b0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-79aff7b5-6b64-51d5-8c15-e972a08c75b0" :answer/value "\frac{\pi }{6}{\sum }_{j=0}^{3}\operatorname{cos}⁡(\frac{j\pi }{2})"] ["answer-30c148ce-3d4b-5f82-be22-94b1b7a941d5" :answer/id #uuid "30c148ce-3d4b-5f82-be22-94b1b7a941d5"] ["answer-30c148ce-3d4b-5f82-be22-94b1b7a941d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-30c148ce-3d4b-5f82-be22-94b1b7a941d5" :answer/value "\frac{\pi }{8}{\sum }_{j=0}^{3}\operatorname{cos}⁡(\frac{j\pi }{8})"] ["answer-field-f9b02b04-3990-5647-8a7e-f4a0b6db0f71" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-f9b02b04-3990-5647-8a7e-f4a0b6db0f71" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-f9b02b