Consider the observation matrix $X$ above, where the individual observations are given in columns. Find the mean-deviation form of $X.$"] ["question-6a4bb009-1382-5d80-b122-5cf6749f1552" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the mean-deviation form of the observation matrix

$$
X=[\begin{aligned}| & | &  & | \\ {x}_{1} & {x}_{2} & ⋯ & {x}_{n} \\ | & | &  & |\end{aligned}]
$$

is given by 

$$
B=[\begin{aligned}| & | &  & | \\ {b}_{1} & {b}_{2} & ⋯ & {b}_{n} \\ | & | &  & |\end{aligned}]
$$

where ${b}_{i}={x}_{i}-m$ for $i=1,2,…,n,$ and $m$ is sample mean vector.

From the matrix, we have that  

$$
{x}_{1}=[\begin{aligned}-5 \\ 7\end{aligned}],\,{x}_{2}=[\begin{aligned}-3 \\ 5\end{aligned}],\,{x}_{3}=[\begin{aligned}2 \\ 0\end{aligned}].
$$

As a result, the sample mean is

$$
\begin{aligned}m & =\frac{1}{3}({x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}) \\  & =\frac{1}{3}([\begin{aligned}-5 \\ 7\end{aligned}]+[\begin{aligned}-3 \\ 5\end{aligned}]+[\begin{aligned}2 \\ 0\end{aligned}]) \\  & =\frac{1}{3}[\begin{aligned}-6 \\ 12\end{aligned}] \\  & =[\begin{aligned}-2 \\ 4\end{aligned}].\end{aligned}
$$

Now, we have the following:

$$
\begin{aligned}{b}_{1} & ={x}_{1}-m=[\begin{aligned}-5 \\ 7\end{aligned}]-[\begin{aligned}-2 \\ 4\end{aligned}]=[\begin{aligned}-3 \\ 3\end{aligned}] \\ {b}_{2} & ={x}_{2}-m=[\begin{aligned}-3 \\ 5\end{aligned}]-[\begin{aligned}-2 \\ 4\end{aligned}]=[\begin{aligned}-1 \\ 1\end{aligned}] \\ {b}_{3} & ={x}_{3}-m=[\begin{aligned}2 \\ 0\end{aligned}]-[\begin{aligned}-2 \\ 4\end{aligned}]=[\begin{aligned}4 \\ -4\end{aligned}]\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore,  the mean-deviation form is

$$
B=[\begin{aligned}-3 & -1 & 4 \\ 3 & 1 & -4\end{aligned}].
$$"] ["question-6a4bb009-1382-5d80-b122-5cf6749f1552" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-b518b34a-8d6e-54eb-93d9-d3cb5a0505b0" :answer-field/id #uuid "b518b34a-8d6e-54eb-93d9-d3cb5a0505b0"] ["answer-bfecac8a-fa87-5d62-a946-7f122c1e66c9" :answer/id #uuid "bfecac8a-fa87-5d62-a946-7f122c1e66c9"] ["answer-bfecac8a-fa87-5d62-a946-7f122c1e66c9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-bfecac8a-fa87-5d62-a946-7f122c1e66c9" :answer/value "[\begin{aligned}-3 & -1 & 4 \\ 3 & 1 & -4\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-581f54a2-60c9-5dc5-bb4d-f8f318fe2d6f" :answer/id #uuid "581f54a2-60c9-5dc5-bb4d-f8f318fe2d6f"] ["answer-581f54a2-60c9-5dc5-bb4d-f8f318fe2d6f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-581f54a2-60c9-5dc5-bb4d-f8f318fe2d6f" :answer/value "[\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 & 2 \\ -2 & -1 & 3\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-7a4429f4-c191-50e8-be52-084fe635f47b" :answer/id #uuid "7a4429f4-c191-50e8-be52-084fe635f47b"] ["answer-7a4429f4-c191-50e8-be52-084fe635f47b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-7a4429f4-c191-50e8-be52-084fe635f47b" :answer/value "[\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & -1 \\ -2 & -1 & 3\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-f1218c8e-974e-52d6-b624-68fd43f78159" :answer/id #uuid "f1218c8e-974e-52d6-b624-68fd43f78159"] ["answer-f1218c8e-974e-52d6-b624-68fd43f78159" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f1218c8e-974e-52d6-b624-68fd43f78159" :answer/value "[\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & -2 \\ -3 & 1 & 4\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-57509c8b-6b98-51aa-9762-9963caf04358" :answer/id #uuid "57509c8b-6b98-51aa-9762-9963caf04358"] ["answer-57509c8b-6b98-51aa-9762-9963caf04358" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-57509c8b-6b98-51aa-9762-9963caf04358" :answer/value "[\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -2 \\ 1 & -1 & 0\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-field-b518b34a-8d6e-54eb-93d9-d3cb5a0505b0" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-b518b34a-8d6e-54eb-93d9-d3cb5a0505b0" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-b518b34a-8d6e-54eb-93d9-d3cb5a0505b0" :answer-field/correct "answer-