Now, we have the following:

$$
\begin{aligned}{b}_{1} & ={x}_{1}-m=[\begin{aligned}4 \\ -3\end{aligned}]-[\begin{aligned}5 \\ 1\end{aligned}]=[\begin{aligned}-1 \\ -4\end{aligned}] \\ {b}_{2} & ={x}_{2}-m=[\begin{aligned}6 \\ 0\end{aligned}]-[\begin{aligned}5 \\ 1\end{aligned}]=[\begin{aligned}1 \\ -1\end{aligned}] \\ {b}_{3} & ={x}_{3}-m=[\begin{aligned}5 \\ 6\end{aligned}]-[\begin{aligned}5 \\ 1\end{aligned}]=[\begin{aligned}0 \\ 5\end{aligned}]\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore,  the mean-deviation form is

$$
B=[\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 0 \\ -4 & -1 & 5\end{aligned}].
$$

Finally, the sample covariance matrix is 

$$
\begin{aligned}C & =\frac{1}{3-1}[\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 0 \\ -4 & -1 & 5\end{aligned}][\begin{aligned}-1 & -4 \\ 1 & -1 \\ 0 & 5\end{aligned}] \\  & =\frac{1}{2}[\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\ 3 & 42\end{aligned}].\end{aligned}
$$"] ["question-d39bfe0e-e6e3-509a-9ccb-2651e206d7a8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-63610fdd-4a0f-5e58-8e91-40c9b79c1b2f" :answer-field/id #uuid "63610fdd-4a0f-5e58-8e91-40c9b79c1b2f"] ["answer-63f36174-881c-57cb-888e-5b635ad28017" :answer/id #uuid "63f36174-881c-57cb-888e-5b635ad28017"] ["answer-63f36174-881c-57cb-888e-5b635ad28017" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-63f36174-881c-57cb-888e-5b635ad28017" :answer/value "\frac{1}{2}[\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\ 3 & -10\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-6a9c88b3-2c09-54a3-99c5-91c575160cb4" :answer/id #uuid "6a9c88b3-2c09-54a3-99c5-91c575160cb4"] ["answer-6a9c88b3-2c09-54a3-99c5-91c575160cb4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6a9c88b3-2c09-54a3-99c5-91c575160cb4" :answer/value "\frac{1}{2}[\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\ 3 & 42\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-82ed669f-a9bd-5e1c-8760-9d608342f7c3" :answer/id #uuid "82ed669f-a9bd-5e1c-8760-9d608342f7c3"] ["answer-82ed669f-a9bd-5e1c-8760-9d608342f7c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-82ed669f-a9bd-5e1c-8760-9d608342f7c3" :answer/value "\frac{1}{2}[\begin{aligned}0 & 5 \\ 5 & 42\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-5f060f18-5f38-57d0-8035-ee521e1efa10" :answer/id #uuid "5f060f18-5f38-57d0-8035-ee521e1efa10"] ["answer-5f060f18-5f38-57d0-8035-ee521e1efa10" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5f060f18-5f38-57d0-8035-ee521e1efa10" :answer/value "\frac{1}{2}[\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\ 3 & 42\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-e3398816-b77b-5ead-950a-9a70459413a7" :answer/id #uuid "e3398816-b77b-5ead-950a-9a70459413a7"] ["answer-e3398816-b77b-5ead-950a-9a70459413a7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e3398816-b77b-5ead-950a-9a70459413a7" :answer/value "\frac{1}{2}[\begin{aligned}2 & 5 \\ 5 & -10\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-field-63610fdd-4a0f-5e58-8e91-40c9b79c1b2f" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-63610fdd-4a0f-5e58-8e91-40c9b79c1b2f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-63610fdd-4a0f-5e58-8e91-40c9b79c1b2f" :answer-field/correct "an