problem "What is the limit of the sequence ${a}_{n}=\frac{(2{n}^{2}+3)(2{n}^{2}-3)}{2n(5{n}^{3}-1)}$ for $n\ge 1?$"] ["question-d26b4fec-f259-5757-943d-c92ed32d5a4b" :question/worked-solution "First, we multiply out the numerator and denominator of the sequence and get

$$
{a}_{n}=\frac{(2{n}^{2}+3)(2{n}^{2}-3)}{2n(5{n}^{3}-1)}=\frac{4{n}^{4}-9}{10{n}^{4}-2n}.
$$

So to find the limit, we will need to compute

$$
{lim}_{n\to \infty }{a}_{n}={lim}_{n\to \infty }\frac{4{n}^{4}-9}{10{n}^{4}-2n}.
$$

The dominant term in the denominator is $10{n}^{4},$ so we divide the numerator and the denominator by ${n}^{4}$ and get

$$
\begin{aligned}{lim}_{n\to \infty }\frac{4{n}^{4}-9}{10{n}^{4}-2n} & ={lim}_{n\to \infty }\frac{(\frac{4{n}^{4}}{{n}^{4}}-\frac{9}{{n}^{4}})}{(\frac{10{n}^{4}}{{n}^{4}}-\frac{2n}{{n}^{4}})} \\  & ={lim}_{n\to \infty }\frac{(4-\frac{9}{{n}^{4}})}{(10-\frac{2}{{n}^{3}})} \\  & =\frac{4-0}{10-0} \\  & =\frac{2}{5}.\end{aligned}
$$

Consequently, the sequence converges and its limit is $\frac{2}{5}.$"] ["question-d26b4fec-f259-5757-943d-c92ed32d5a4b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-5d7987cd-9189-59ea-8be9-6b86123a7745" :answer-field/id #uuid "5d7987cd-9189-59ea-8be9-6b86123a7745"] ["answer-1a58b002-6268-59f9-8d62-d5780db00a57" :answer/id #uuid "1a58b002-6268-59f9-8d62-d5780db00a57"] ["answer-1a58b002-6268-59f9-8d62-d5780db00a57" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-1a58b002-6268-59f9-8d62-d5780db00a57" :answer/value "0"] ["answer-975f8bf1-29e1-5e24-8470-e16a6bceb947" :answer/id #uuid "975f8bf1-29e1-5e24-8470-e16a6bceb947"] ["answer-975f8bf1-29e1-5e24-8470-e16a6bceb947" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-975f8bf1-29e1-5e24-8470-e16a6bceb947" :answer/value "1"] ["answer-78d710b0-36b9-5af3-afee-6ec469874bb2" :answer/id #uuid "78d710b0-36b9-5af3-afee-6ec469874bb2"] ["answer-78d710b0-36b9-5af3-afee-6ec469874bb2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-78d710b0-36b9-5af3-afee-6ec469874bb2" :answer/value "\frac{2}{5}"] ["answer-e2169256-da89-5b10-b1ae-084da0651fe3" :answer/id #uuid "e2169256-da89-5b10-b1ae-084da0651fe3"] ["answer-e2169256-da89-5b10-b1ae-084da0651fe3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e2169256-da89-5b10-b1ae-084da0651fe3" :answer/value "\frac{5}{2}"] ["answer-1084ac63-ef9b-56cc-bcb8-ef50cf2a751e" :answer/id #uuid "1084ac63-ef9b-56cc-bcb8-ef50cf2a751e"] ["answer-1084ac63-ef9b-56cc-bcb8-ef50cf2a751e" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-1084ac63-ef9b-56cc-bcb8-ef50cf2a751e" :answer/value "The sequence diverges"] ["answer-field-5d7987cd-9189-59ea-8be9-6b86123a7745" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-5d7987cd-9189-59ea-8be9-6b86123a7745" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-5d7987cd-9189-59ea-8be9-6b86123a7745" :answer-field/correct "answer-78d710b0-36b9-5af3-afee-6ec469874bb2"] ["answer-field-5d7987cd-9189-59ea-8be9-6b86123a7745" :answer-field/choices "answer-1a58b002-6268-59f9-8d62-d5780db00a57"] ["answer-field-5d7987cd-9189-59ea-8be9-6b86123a7745" :answer-field/choices "answer-975f8bf1-29e1-5e24-8470-e16a6bceb947"] ["answer-field-5d7987cd-9189-59ea-8be9-6b86123a7745" :answer-field/choices "answer-78d710b0-36b9-5af3-afee-6ec469874bb2"] ["answer-field-5d7987cd-9189-59ea-8be9-6b86123a7745" :answer-field/choices "answer-e2169256-da89-5b10-b1ae-084da0651fe3"] ["answer-field-5d7987cd-9189-59ea-8be9-6b86123a7745" :answer-field/choices "answer-1084ac63-ef9b-56cc-bcb8-ef50cf2a751e"] ["question-d26b4fec-f259-5757-943d-c92ed32d5a4b" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-5d7987cd-9189-59ea-8be9-6b86123a7745"] [17592186096743 :knowledge-point/questions "question-d26b4fec-f259-5757-943d-c92ed32d5a4b"] ["question-f593ac8e-7a29-5f43-82ff-aea84a5ba69c" :question/id #uuid "f593ac8e-7a29-5f43-82ff-aea84a5ba69c"] ["question-f593ac8e-7a29-5f43-82ff-aea84a5ba69c" :question/math-academy-id "q-123332"] ["question-f593ac8e-7a29-5f43-82ff-aea84a5ba69c" :question/problem "What is the limit of the sequence ${a}_{n}=\frac{(3n-2)(3n+2)}{n(1-9n)}$ for $n\ge 1?$"] ["question-f593ac8e-7a29-5f43-82ff-aea84a5ba69c" :question/worked-solution "First, we multiply out the numerator and denominator of the sequence and get

$$
{a}_{n}=\frac{(3n-2)(3n+2)}{n(1-9n)}=\frac{9{n}^{2}-4}{n-9{n}^{2}}.
$$

So to find the limit, we will need to compute

$$
{lim}_{n\to \infty }{a}_{n}={lim}_{n\to \infty }\frac{9{n}^{2}-4}{n-9{n}^{2}}.
$$

The dominant term in the denominator is $-9{n}^{2},$ so we divide the numerator and the denominator by ${n}^{2}$ and get

$$
\begin{aligned}{lim}_{n\to \infty }\frac{9{n}^{2}-4}{n-9{n}^{2}} & ={lim}_{n\to \infty }\frac{(\frac{9{n}^{2}}{{n}^{2}}-\frac{4}{{n}^{2}})}{(\frac{n}{{n}^{2}}-\frac{9{n}^{2}}{{n}^{2}})} \\  & ={lim}_{n\to \infty }\frac{(9-\frac{4}{{n}^{2}})}{(\frac{1}{n}-9)} \\  & =\frac{9-0}{0-9} \\  & =-1.\end{aligned}
$$

Consequently, the sequence converges and its limit is $-1.$"] ["question-f593ac8e-7a29-5f43-82ff-aea84a5ba69c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-0759db57-b8ce-5f50-b46e-8b442e52ee62" :answer-field/id #uuid "0759db57-b8ce-5f50-b46e-8b442e52ee62"] ["answer-ddcaa7ca-0c0c-5d03-adf8-e0d7f6832969" :answer/id #uuid "ddcaa7ca-0c0c-5d03-adf8-e0d7f6832969"] ["answer-ddcaa7ca-0c0c-5d03-adf8-e0d7f6832969" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ddcaa7ca-0c0c-5d03-adf8-e0d7f6832969" :answer/value "-1"] ["answer-973d5ba1-9f1d-5d54-a5a6-681dae8dfc0a" :answer/id #uuid "973d5ba1-9f1d-5d54-a5a6-681dae8dfc0a"] ["answer-973d5ba1-9f1d-5d54-a5a6-681dae8dfc0a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-973d5ba1-9f1d-5d54-a5a6-681dae8dfc0a" :answer/value "0"] ["answer-ba2648e8-3c45-5b47-8bbc-61b0f969add5" :answer/id #uuid "ba2648e8-3c45-5b47-8bbc-61b0f969add5"] ["answer-ba2648e8-3c45-5b47-8bbc-61b0f969add5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ba2648e8-3c45-5b47-8bbc-61b0f969add5" :answer/value "9"] ["answer-5ca0fb74-d0d3-5f86-be12-a821fb96b41e" :answer/id #uuid "5ca0fb74-d0d3-5f86-be12-a821fb96b41e"] ["answer-5ca0fb74-d0d3-5f86-be12-a821fb96b41e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5ca0fb74-d0d3-5f86-be12-a821fb96b41e" :answer/value "\frac{4}{9}"] ["answer-fa7ed841-cc61-56c4-b2ed-0e53c44c292c" :answer/id #uuid "fa7ed841-cc61-56c4-b2ed-0e53c44c292c"] ["answer-fa7ed841-cc61-56c4-b2ed-0e53c44c292c" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-fa7ed841-cc61-56c4-b2ed-0e53c44c292c" :answer/value "The sequence diverges"] ["answer-field-0759db57-b8ce-5f50-b46e-8b442e52ee62" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-0759db57-b8ce-5f50-b46e-8b442e52ee62" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-0759db57-b8ce-5f50-b46e-8b442e52ee62" :answer-field/correct "answer-ddcaa7ca-0c0c-5d03-adf8-e0d7f6832969"] ["answer-field-0759db57-b8ce-5f50-b46e-8b442e52ee62" :answer-field/choices "answer-ddcaa7ca-0c0c-5d03-adf8-e0d7f6832969"] ["answer-field-0759db57-b8ce-5f50-b46e-8b442e52ee62" :answer-field/choices "answer-973d5ba1-9f1d-5d54-a5a6-681dae8dfc0a"] ["answer-field-0759db57-b8ce-5f50-b46e-8b442e52ee62" :answer-field/choices "answer-ba2648e8-3c45-5b47-8bbc-61b0f969add5"] ["answer-field-0759db57-b8ce-5f50-b46e-8b442e52ee62" :answer-field/choices "answer-5ca0fb74-d0d3-5f86-be12-a821fb96b41e"] ["answer-field-0759db57-b8ce-5f50-b46e-8b442e52ee62" :answer-field/choices "answer-fa7ed841-cc61-56c4-b2ed-0e53c44c292c"] ["question-f593ac8e-7a29-5f43-82ff-aea84a5ba69c" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-0759db57-b8ce-5f50-b46e-8b442e52ee62"] [17592186096743 :knowledge-point/questions "question-f593ac8e-7a29-5f43-82ff-aea84a5ba69c"] ["question-548006ed-ff60-5fe8-9b17-af5147ac7aae" :question/id #uuid "548006ed-ff60-5fe8-9b17-af5147ac7aae"] ["question-548006ed-ff60-5fe8-9b17-af5147ac7aae" :question/math-academy-id "q-347972"] ["question-548006ed-ff60-5fe8-9b17-af5147ac7aae" :question/problem "What is the limit of the sequence ${a}_{n}=\frac{12n+1}{3n}$ for $n\ge 1?$

${lim}_{n\to \infty }{a}_{n}=$
{{field-1}}"] ["question-548006ed-ff60-5fe8-9b17-af5147ac7aae" :question/worked-solution "To determine whether the sequence converges or diverges, we need to determine the limit of the sequence as $n$ approaches infinity:

$$
{lim}_{n\to \infty }{a}_{n}={lim}_{n\to \infty }\frac{12n+1}{3n}.
$$

The dominant term in the denominator is $3n,$ so we divide the numerator and the denominator by $n$ and get

$$
\begin{aligned}{lim}_{n\to \infty }{a}_{n} & ={lim}_{n\to \infty }\frac{12n+1}{3n} \\  & ={lim}_{n\to \infty }\frac{(\frac{12n}{n}+\frac{1}{n})}{\frac{3n}{n}} \\  & ={lim}_{n\to \infty }\frac{12+\frac{1}{n}}{3} \\  & =\frac{12+0}{3} \\  & =4.\end{aligned}
$$

Consequently, the sequence converges, and its limit is $4.$"] ["question-548006ed-ff60-5fe8-9b17-af5147ac7aae" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-c43acc61-3f4b-58f8-9442-6e3ef8f460f7" :answer-field/id #uuid "c43acc61-3f4b-58f8-9442-6e3ef8f460f7"] ["answer-ea68bf8b-4deb-5b99-92c1-18ea456b7de6" :answer/id #uuid "ea68bf8b-4deb-5b99-92c1-18ea456b7de6"] ["answer-ea68bf8b-4deb-5b99-92c1-18ea456b7de6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ea68bf8b-4deb-5b99-92c1-18ea456b7de6" :answer/value "4"] ["answer-field-c43acc61-3f4b-58f8-9442-6e3ef8f460f7" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-c43acc61-3f4b-58f8-9442-6e3ef8f460f7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-c43acc61-3f4b-58f8-9442-6e3ef8f460f7" :answer-field/correct "answer-ea68bf8b-4deb-5b99-92c1-18ea456b7de6"] ["answer-field-c43acc61-3f4b-58f8-9442-6e3ef8f460f7" :answer-field/choices "answer-ea68bf8b-4deb-5b99-92c1-18ea456b7de6"] ["question-548006ed-ff60-5fe8-9b17-af5147ac7aae" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-c43acc61-3f4b-58f8-9442-6e3ef8f460f7"] [17592186096741 :knowledge-point/questions "question-548006ed-ff60-5fe8-9b17-af5147ac7aae"] ["activity-a4edf402-bea0-5a44-bc5e-8ea032b32554" :activity/id #uuid "a4edf402-bea0-5a44-bc5e-8ea032b32554"] ["step-06677fb3-7ea6-5165-8cd4-81f9a96fa023" :step/id #uuid "06677fb3-7ea6-5165-8cd4-81f9a96fa023"] ["step-1718a7b4-2d06-538f-8e12-c06876a48a52" :step/id #uuid "1718a7b4-2d06-538f-8e12-c06876a48a52"] ["step-662b9fe1-3bf2-5624-8370-6f85b744866a" :step/id #uuid "662b9fe1-3bf2-5624-8370-6f85b744866a"] ["step-07528adf-f296-5070-8943-009a2dae445f" :step/id #uuid "07528adf-f296-5070-8943-009a2dae445f"] ["step-55189c97-78f2-5c38-9d2b-e6e0a11aa6ba" :step/id #uuid "55189c97-78f2-5c38-9d2b-e6e0a11aa6ba"] ["step-06677fb3-7ea6-5165-8cd4-81f9a96fa023" :step/content "question-d26b4fec-f259-5757-943d-c92ed32d5a4b"] ["step-06677fb3-7ea6-5165-8cd4-81f9a96fa023" :step/next "step-1718a7b4-2d06-538f-8e12-c06876a48a52"] ["step-1718a7b4-2