2" :question/worked-solution "The variable $z$ is being *multiplied* by $-5.$ To isolate $z,$ we perform the *opposite* operation, which is *dividing* by $-5.$ Remember to perform the same operation on both sides.

Also, when multiplying or dividing an inequality by a negative number, we need to flip the inequality sign:

$$
\begin{aligned}-5z\,\, & \le \,\,-1 \\ \frac{-5z}{-5}\,\, & \ge \,\,\frac{-1}{-5} \\ \frac{-5z}{-5}\,\, & \ge \,\,\frac{1}{5}\end{aligned}
$$

Now, we can cancel a common factor of $-5$ from both the numerator and denominator.

$$
\begin{aligned}\frac{-5z}{-5} & \ge \frac{1}{5} \\ \frac{\cancel{-5}z}{\cancel{-5}} & \ge \frac{1}{5} \\ z & \ge \frac{1}{5}\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore, the solution is $z\ge \frac{1}{5}.$"] ["question-60d9e1c1-b611-5995-967c-6c66ed571c82" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-b60c1271-2aa2-5db6-a4fc-0ced692f3cad" :answer-field/id #uuid "b60c1271-2aa2-5db6-a4fc-0ced692f3cad"] ["answer-b94c625a-806d-5398-a511-8434b5363807" :answer/id #uuid "b94c625a-806d-5398-a511-8434b5363807"] ["answer-b94c625a-806d-5398-a511-8434b5363807" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b94c625a-806d-5398-a511-8434b5363807" :answer/value "z\ge -\frac{1}{5}"] ["answer-91b033fa-0ab3-5c2d-87b8-9809d0825695" :answer/id #uuid "91b033fa-0ab3-5c2d-87b8-9809d0825695"] ["answer-91b033fa-0ab3-5c2d-87b8-9809d0825695" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-91b033fa-0ab3-5c2d-87b8-9809d0825695" :answer/value "z\ge 4"] ["answer-11e4be9b-77ce-5d2c-870a-9582c9f4eacc" :answer/id #uuid "11e4be9b-77ce-5d2c-870a-9582c9f4eacc"] ["answer-11e4be9b-77ce-5d2c-870a-9582c9f4eacc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-11e4be9b-77ce-5d2c-870a-9582c9f4eacc" :answer/value "z\ge \frac{1}{5}"] ["answer-729d4612-b4b3-52d6-a984-56bcadb47c63" :answer/id #uuid "729d4612-b4b3-52d6-a984-56bcadb47c63"] ["answer-729d4612-b4b3-52d6-a984-56bcadb47c63" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-729d4612-b4b3-52d6-a984-56bcadb47c63" :answer/value "z\le -\frac{1}{5}"] ["answer-9bb97e3f-8e17-5d53-9ebf-0d14a1a104c9" :answer/id #uuid "9bb97e3f-8e17-5d53-9ebf-0d14a1a104c9"] ["answer-9bb97e3f-8e17-5d53-9ebf-0d14a1a104c9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9bb97e3f-8e17-5d53-9ebf-0d14a1a104c9" :answer/value "z\le \frac{1}{5}"] ["answer-field-b60c1271-2aa2-5db6-a4fc-0ced692f3cad" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-b60c1271-2aa2-5db6-a4fc-0ced692f3cad" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-b60c1271-2aa2-5db6-a4fc-0ced692f3cad" :answer-field/correct "answer-11e4be9b-77ce-5d2c-870a-9582c9f4eacc"] ["answer-field-b60c1271-2aa2-5db6-a4fc-0ced692f3cad" :answer-field/choices "answer-b94c625a-806d-5398-a511-8434b5363807"] ["answer-field-b60c1271-2aa2-5db6-a4fc-0ced692f3cad" :answer-field/choices "answer-91b033fa-0ab3-5c2d-87b8-9809d0825695"] ["answer-field-b60c1271-2aa2-5db6-a4fc-0ced692f3cad" :answer-field/choices "answer-11e4be9b-77ce-5d2c-870a-9582c9f4eacc"] ["answer-field-b60c1271-2aa2-5db6-a4fc-0ced692f3cad" :answer-field/choices "answer-729d4612-b4b3-52d6-a984-56bcadb47c63"] ["answer-field-b60c1271-2aa2-5db6-a4fc-0ced692f3cad" :answer-field/choices "answer-9bb97e3f-8e17-5d53-9ebf-0d14a1a104c9"] ["question-60d9e1c1-b611-5995-967c-6c66ed571c82" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-b60c1271-2aa2-5db6-a4fc-0ced692f3cad"] [17592186054770 :knowledge-point/questions "question-60d9e1c1-b611-5995-967c-6c66ed571c82"] ["question-a6005239-b6a4-5801-8173-53f2d74d92ea" :question/id #uuid "a6005239-b6a4-5801-8173-53f2d74d92ea"] ["question-a6005239-b6a4-5801-8173-53f2d74d92ea" :question/math-academy-id "q-153600"] ["question-a6005239-b6a4-5801-8173-53f2d74d92ea" :question/problem "Solve the inequality $4\le x+7.$"] ["question-a6005239-b6a4-5801-8173-53f2d74d92ea" :question/worked-solution "To isolate $x,$ we need to perform the *opposite* of *adding* $7,$ which is *subtracting* $7.$ Remember to perform the same operation on both sides.

$$
\begin{aligned}4 & \le x+7 \\ 4-7 & \le x+7-7 \\ -3 & \le x+0 \\ -3 & \le x\end{aligned}
$$

Finally, we rewrite the inequality with the variable on the left-hand side:

$$
x\ge -3
$$

Therefore, the solution is $x\ge -3.$"] ["question-a6005239-b6a4-5801-8173-53f2d74d92ea" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-e410432f-86a4-50ea-8294-40d4d0eeeb2f" :answer-field/id #uuid "e410432f-86a4-50ea-8294-40d4d0eeeb2f"] ["answer-6e12aa20-0d6e-5360-a6c8-7346274c8177" :answer/id #uuid "6e12aa20-0d6e-5360-a6c8-7346274c8177"] ["answer-6e12aa20-0d6e-5360-a6c8-7346274c8177" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6e12aa20-0d6e-5360-a6c8-7346274c8177" :answer/value "x\ge -3"] ["answer-6395e4d6-160c-524d-bea0-39d0f0cb0acb" :answer/id #uuid "6395e4d6-160c-524d-bea0-39d0f0cb0acb"] ["answer-6395e4d6-160c-524d-bea0-39d0f0cb0acb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6395e4d6-160c-524d-bea0-39d0f0cb0acb" :answer/value "x\ge 11"] ["answer-360ebf0c-440b-5b80-aa5d-f220ea76cfe8" :answer/id #uuid "360ebf0c-440b-5b80-aa5d-f220ea76cfe8"] ["answer-360ebf0c-440b-5b80-aa5d-f220ea76cfe8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-360ebf0c-440b-5b80-aa5d-f220ea76cfe8" :answer/value "x\ge 3"] ["answer-60e57476-d7c3-5931-afaa-b90f394b253b" :answer/id #uuid "60e57476-d7c3-5931-afaa-b90f394b253b"] ["answer-60e57476-d7c3-5931-afaa-b90f394b253b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-60e57476-d7c3-5931-afaa-b90f394b253b" :answer/value "x\le -3"] ["answer-a9e80f2e-a321-5d67-acf6-345376f7ea8f" :answer/id #uuid "a9e80f2e-a321-5d67-acf6-345376f7ea8f"] ["answer-a9e80f2e-a321-5d67-acf6-345376f7ea8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a9e80f2e-a321-5d67-acf6-345376f7ea8f" :answer/value "x\le 3"] ["answer-field-e410432f-86a4-50ea-8294-40d4d0eeeb2f" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-e410432f-86a4-50ea-8294-40d4d0eeeb2f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-e410432f-86a4-50ea-8294-40d4d0eeeb2f" :answer-field/correct "answer-6e12aa20-0d6e-5360-a6c8-7346274c8177"] ["answer-field-e410432f-86a4-50ea-8294-40d4d0eeeb2f" :answer-field/choices "answer-6e12aa20-0d6e-5360-a6c8-7346274c8177"] ["answer-field-e410432f-86a4-50ea-8294-40d4d0eeeb2f" :answer-field/choices "answer-6395e4d6-160c-524d-bea0-39d0f0cb0acb"] ["answer-field-e410432f-86a4-50ea-8294-40d4d0eeeb2f" :answer-field/choices "answer-360ebf0c-440b-5b80-aa5d-f220ea76cfe8"] ["answer-field-e410432f-86a4-50ea-8294-40d4d0eeeb2f" :answer-field/choices "answer-60e57476-d7c3-5931-afaa-b90f394b253b"] ["answer-field-e410432f-86a4-50ea-8294-40d4d0eeeb2f" :answer-field/choices "answer-a9e80f2e-a321-5d67-acf6-345376f7ea8f"] ["question-a6005239-b6a4-5801-8173-53f2d74d92ea" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-e410432f-86a4-50ea-8294-40d4d0eeeb2f"] [17592186054772 :knowledge-point/questions "question-a6005239-b6a4-5801-8173-53f2d74d92ea"] [17592186055021 :question/problem "Solve the inequality $-\frac{x}{2}\le 4.$"] [17592186055021 :question/worked-solution "The variable $x$ is being *divided* by $2.$ To isolate $x$ and remove the negative sign, we *multiply* by $-2.$ 

Remember, when multiplying or dividing an inequality by a negative number, we need to flip the inequality sign:

$$
\begin{aligned}-\frac{x}{2}\,\, & \le \,\,4 \\ (-2)\cdot (-\frac{x}{2})\,\, & \ge \,\,(-2)\cdot 4 \\ (-2)\cdot (-\frac{x}{2})\,\, & \ge \,\,-8\end{aligned}
$$

Since two negative numbers multiply to give a positive number, we first cancel the negatives:

$$
\begin{aligned}(-2)\cdot (-\frac{x}{2}) & \ge -8 \\ (\cancel{-}2)\cdot (\cancel{-}\frac{x}{2}) & \ge -8 \\ 2\cdot \frac{x}{2} & \ge -8\end{aligned}
$$

Now, we can cancel a common factor of $2$ from both the numerator and denominator.

$$
\begin{aligned}2\cdot \frac{x}{2} & \ge -8 \\ \frac{2x}{2} & \ge -8 \\ \frac{\cancel{2}x}{\cancel{2}} & \ge -8 \\ x & \ge -8\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore, the solution is $x\ge -8.$"] [17592186055021 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-ba590d86-ddb8-598a-a220-46efedf147bc" :answer/id #uuid "ba590d86-ddb8-598a-a220-46efedf147bc"] ["answer-ba590d86-ddb8-598a-a220-46efedf147bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ba590d86-ddb8-598a-a220-46efedf147bc" :answer/value "x\ge -8"] ["answer-55632b59-8ff0-5f33-bd84-759756febdc5" :answer/id #uuid "55632b59-8ff0-5f33-bd84-759756febdc5"] ["answer-55632b59-8ff0-5f33-bd84-759756febdc5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-55632b59-8ff0-5f33-bd84-759756febdc5" :answer/value "x\ge 6"] ["answer-249f7541-1a8a-52ec-9e0c-a25f296e0698" :answer/id #uuid "249f7541-1a8a-52ec-9e0c-a25f296e0698"] ["answer-249f7541-1a8a-52ec-9e0c-a25f296e0698" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-249f7541-1a8a-52ec-9e0c-a25f296e0698" :answer/value "x\ge 8"] ["answer-e10696b4-01d9-5bd2-8740-a24555a84567" :answer/id #uuid "e10696b4-01d9-5bd2-8740-a24555a84567"] ["answer-e10696b4-01d9-5bd2-8740-a24555a84567" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e10696b4-01d9-5bd2-8740-a24555a84567" :answer/value "x\le -8"] ["answer-99888988-7d3e-5baa-ab4a-decbb3967954" :answer/id #uuid "99888988-7d3e-5baa-ab4a-decbb3967954"] ["answer-99888988-7d3e-5baa-ab4a-decbb3967954" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-99888988-7d3e-5baa-ab4a-decbb3967954" :answer/value "x\le 8"] [17592186051656 :answer-field/correct "answer-ba590d86-ddb8-598a-a220-46efedf147bc"] [17592186051656 :answer-field/choices "answer-ba590d86-ddb8-598a-a220-46efedf147bc"] [17592186051656 :answer-field/choices "answer-55632b59-8ff0-5f33-bd84-759756febdc5"] [17592186051656 :answer-field/choices "answer-249f7541-1a8a-52ec-9e0c-a25f296e0698"] [17592186051656 :answer-field/choices "answer-e10696b4-01d9-5bd2-8740-a24555a84567"] [17592186051656 :answer-field/choices "answer-99888988-7d3e-5baa-ab4a-decbb3967954"] ["activity-a0296a38-e916-56a7-bb47-0737bade1abd" :activity/id #uuid "a0296a38-e916-56a7-bb47-0737bade1abd"] ["step