Notice the following properties of the given slope field:

- First, the slope lines on the same vertical line are all the same. This means that the slope does not vary with $y.$ In other words, ${y}^{′}$ is a function of $x$ only.

Of the given equations, the only equations that satisfy this condition are the following:

$$
\begin{aligned} & {y}^{′}=\frac{1}{x} \\  & {y}^{′}={e}^{x} \\  & {y}^{′}={x}^{2}\end{aligned}
$$

- Second, the slopes become vertical as $x\to 0.$ 

Of the remaining options, the only one that gives this behavior is

$$
{y}^{′}=\frac{1}{x}.
$$

Notice that

$$
|{y}^{′}|=|\frac{1}{x}|\to \infty \,\text{as}\,x\to 0.
$$

Therefore, the slopes of the slope field for the differential equation ${y}^{′}=\frac{1}{x}$ become vertical as $x\to 0.$
By contrast, 

$$
{y}^{′}={e}^{x}\to 1\,\text{as}\,x\to 0,
$$

and

$$
{y}^{′}={x}^{2}\to 0\,\text{as}\,x\to 0.
$$

Therefore, the required equation is

$$
{y}^{′}=\frac{1}{x}.
$$"] ["question-8972fb0a-9f6e-50fc-86fb-a54e4588df90" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-fb57608e-2ee3-5d75-9465-c30eb8072dad" :answer-field/id #uuid "fb57608e-2ee3-5d75-9465-c30eb8072dad"] ["answer-aaff3195-01f3-5afb-88f1-a42822d0cbe3" :answer/id #uuid "aaff3195-01f3-5afb-88f1-a42822d0cbe3"] ["answer-aaff3195-01f3-5afb-88f1-a42822d0cbe3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-aaff3195-01f3-5afb-88f1-a42822d0cbe3" :answer/value "{y}^{′}=\frac{1}{x}"] ["answer-4a90b7e9-8188-53a6-95fc-db777d59155f" :answer/id #uuid "4a90b7e9-8188-53a6-95fc-db777d59155f"] ["answer-4a90b7e9-8188-53a6-95fc-db777d59155f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4a90b7e9-8188-53a6-95fc-db777d59155f" :answer/value "{y}^{′}=\frac{1}{x}+\frac{1}{y}"] ["answer-007e39a0-05eb-578a-a48d-5694fcd3c657" :answer/id #uuid "007e39a0-05eb-578a-a48d-5694fcd3c657"] ["answer-007e39a0-05eb-578a-a48d-5694fcd3c657" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-007e39a0-05eb-578a-a48d-5694fcd3c657" :answer/value "{y}^{′}=\frac{1}{y}"] ["answer-6324d0c2-5334-554d-8b13-506fc5b5dbb6" :answer/id #uuid "6324d0c2-5334-554d-8b13-506fc5b5dbb6"] ["answer-6324d0c2-5334-554d-8b13-506fc5b5dbb6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6324d0c2-5334-554d-8b13-506fc5b5dbb6" :answer/value "{y}^{′}={e}^{x}"] ["answer-9f9da200-0ade-54bf-b021-af17d6df52d1" :answer/id #uuid "9f9da200-0ade-54bf-b021-af17d6df52d1"] ["answer-9f9da200-0ade-54bf-b021-af17d6df52d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9f9da200-0ade-54bf-b021-af17d6df52d1" :answer/value "{y}^{′}={x}^{2}"] ["answer-field-fb57608e-2ee3-5d75-9465-c30eb8072dad" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-fb57608e-2ee3-5d75-9465-c30eb8072dad" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-fb57608e-2ee3-5d75-9465-c30eb8072dad" :answer-field/correct "answer-aaff3195-01f3-5afb-88f1-a42822d0cbe3"] ["answer-field-fb57608e-2ee3-5d75-9465-c30eb8072dad" :answer-field/choices "answer-aaff3195-01f3-5afb-88f1-a42822d0cbe3"] ["answer-field-fb