a3f0a422a85" :activity/id #uuid "884db384-9de1-557a-84a4-3a3f0a422a85"] ["step-848fd617-c737-54e6-85bd-c49cba43ccd4" :step/id #uuid "848fd617-c737-54e6-85bd-c49cba43ccd4"] ["step-848fd617-c737-54e6-85bd-c49cba43ccd4" :step/content "assigned-problem-51de3932-d411-58ac-b226-f2b9dcd0fc96"] ["activity-884db384-9de1-557a-84a4-3a3f0a422a85" :activity/title "Constructing a Taylor Polynomial Using a Graph, Estimating Functions, and the Alternating Series Error Bound"] ["activity-884db384-9de1-557a-84a4-3a3f0a422a85" :activity/type :activity.type/assignment] ["activity-884db384-9de1-557a-84a4-3a3f0a422a85" :activity/steps "step-848fd617-c737-54e6-85bd-c49cba43ccd4"] ["activity-884db384-9de1-557a-84a4-3a3f0a422a85" :activity/first-step "step-848fd617-c737-54e6-85bd-c49cba43ccd4"] ["question-3b535844-eddd-540b-a454-365555c2e28f" :question/id #uuid "3b535844-eddd-540b-a454-365555c2e28f"] ["question-3b535844-eddd-540b-a454-365555c2e28f" :question/math-academy-id "q-251875"] ["question-3b535844-eddd-540b-a454-365555c2e28f" :question/problem "Consider the two sets of $5$ paired observations shown in the table below.

| **$\,{x}_{i}\,$** | $5$ | $8$ | $9$ | $5$ | $6$ |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **$\,{y}_{i}\,$** | $8$ | $9$ | $10$ | $7$ | $9$ |

Calculate ${S}_{xy}.$"] ["question-3b535844-eddd-540b-a454-365555c2e28f" :question/worked-solution "Given a set of $n$ paired observations ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}$ and ${y}_{1},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{n},$ ${S}_{xy}$ is the sum of products of the deviations of ${x}_{i}$ and ${y}_{i}$ from their respective means, that is

$$
\begin{aligned}{S}_{xy} & ={\sum }_{i=1}^{n}({x}_{i}-\overset{―}{x})({y}_{i}-\overset{―}{y}).\end{aligned}
$$

First, we calculate the sample means $\overset{―}{x}$ and $\overset{―}{y}:$

$$
\overset{―}{x}=\frac{5+8+9+5+6}{5}=6.6
$$

$$
\overset{―}{y}=\frac{8+9+10+7+9}{5}=8.6
$$

Next, we calculate the differences between the ${x}_{i}$ and $\overset{―}{x}$, ${y}_{i}$ and $\overset{―}{y}$, and their product.

| **$\,{x}_{i}\,$** | $5$ | $8$ | $9$ | $5$ | $6$ |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **$\,{y}_{i}\,$** | $8$ | $9$ | $10$ | $7$ | $9$ |
| **$\,({x}_{i}-\overset{―}{x})\,$** | $-1.6$ | $1.4$ | $2.4$ | $-1.6$ | $-0.6$ |
| **$\,({y}_{i}-\overset{―}{y})\,$** | $-0.6$ | $0.4$ | $1.4$ | $-1.6$ | $0.4$ |
| **$\,({x}_{i}-\overset{―}{x})({y}_{i}-\overset{―}{y})\,$** | $0.96$ | $0.56$ | $3.36$ | $2.56$ | $-0.24$ |

Therefore, ${S}_{xy}$ is

$$
{S}_{xy}=0.96+0.56+3.36+2.56+(-0.24)=7.2.
