swer-field/choices "answer-47de3422-ffeb-5a17-b14f-74498ea093ca"] ["answer-field-9d05e707-cf16-5915-a547-c70d2c206fee" :answer-field/choices "answer-f1f5c552-e8d5-558d-8758-dda8b1d41492"] ["answer-field-9d05e707-cf16-5915-a547-c70d2c206fee" :answer-field/choices "answer-d3e6e201-f276-5cd8-881c-e11c2c1e59c2"] ["answer-field-9d05e707-cf16-5915-a547-c70d2c206fee" :answer-field/choices "answer-7d408cf0-77ba-54f6-afce-3f39ab3ef960"] ["question-3b535844-eddd-540b-a454-365555c2e28f" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-9d05e707-cf16-5915-a547-c70d2c206fee"] [17592186204008 :knowledge-point/questions "question-3b535844-eddd-540b-a454-365555c2e28f"] ["question-e546cbd8-6c28-59cf-9108-41c070e316fd" :question/id #uuid "e546cbd8-6c28-59cf-9108-41c070e316fd"] ["question-e546cbd8-6c28-59cf-9108-41c070e316fd" :question/math-academy-id "q-251876"] ["question-e546cbd8-6c28-59cf-9108-41c070e316fd" :question/problem "Consider the two sets of $7$ paired observations shown in the table below.

| **$\,{x}_{i}\,$** | $1.2$ | $1.0$ | $0.7$ | $1.3$ | $1.8$ | $1.7$ | $1.4$ |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **$\,{y}_{i}\,$** | $6.6$ | $6.1$ | $5.7$ | $6.0$ | $6.3$ | $5.9$ | $5.4$ |

Calculate ${S}_{xy}.$"] ["question-e546cbd8-6c28-59cf-9108-41c070e316fd" :question/worked-solution "Given a set of $n$ paired observations ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}$ and ${y}_{1},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{n},$ ${S}_{xy}$ is the sum of products of the deviations of ${x}_{i}$ and ${y}_{i}$ from their respective means, that is

$$
\begin{aligned}{S}_{xy} & ={\sum }_{i=1}^{n}({x}_{i}-\overset{―}{x})({y}_{i}-\overset{―}{y}).\end{aligned}
$$

First, we calculate the sample means $\overset{―}{x}$ and $\overset{―}{y}:$

$$
\overset{―}{x}=\frac{1.2+1.0+0.7+1.3+1.8+1.4+1.7}{7}=1.3
$$

$$
\overset{―}{y}=\frac{6.6+6.1+5.7+6.0+6.3+5.9+5.4}{7}=6
$$

Next, we calculate the differences between the ${x}_{i}$ and $\overset{―}{x}$, ${y}_{i}$ and $\overset{―}{y}$, and their product.

| **$\,{x}_{i}\,$** | $1.2$ | $1.0$ | $0.7$ | $1.3$ | $1.8$ | $1.7$ | $1.4$ |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **$\,{y}_{i}\,$** | $6.6$ | $6.1$ | $5.7$ | $6.0$ | $6.3$ | $5.9$ | $5.4$ |
| **$\,({x}_{i}-\overset{―}{x})\,$** | $-0.1$ | $-0.3$ | $-0.6$ | $0$ | $0.5$ | $0.4$ | $0.1$ |
| **$\,({y}_{i}-\overset{―}{y})\,$** | $0.6$ | $0.1$ | $-0.3$ | $0$ | $0.3$ | $-0.1$ | $-0.6$ |
| **$\,({x}_{i}-\overset{―}{x})({y}_{i}-\overset{―}{y})\,$** | $-0.06$ | $-0.03$ | $0.18$ | $0$ | $0.15$ | $-0.04$ | $-0.06$ |

Therefore, ${S}_{xy}$ is

$$
{S}_{xy}=(-0.06)+(-0.03)+0.18+0+0.15+(-0.04)+(-0.06)=0.14.
$$"] ["question-e546cbd8-6c28-59cf-9108-41c070e316fd" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-5b37bc23-4463-5cf2-acb2-e2f4162f0ffc" :answer-field/id #uuid "5b37bc23-4463-5cf2-acb2-e2f4162f0ffc"] ["answer-3a4e3e32-81eb-5215-b6e7-ca840cc59c2c" :answer/id #uuid "3a4e3e32-81eb-5215-b6e7-ca840cc59c2c"] ["answer-3a4e3e32-81eb-5215-b6e7-ca840cc59c2c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3a4e3e32-81eb-5215-b6e7-ca840cc59c2c" :answer/value "{S}_{xy}=0.06"] ["answer-87b37972-f264-5fe7-be91-6532a22909a4" :answer/id #uuid "87b37972-f264-5fe7-be91-6532a22909a4"] ["answer-87b37972-f264-5fe7-be91-6532a22909a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-87b37972-f264-5fe7-be91-6532a22909a4" :answer/value "{S}_{xy}=0.14"] ["answer-f0f966f8-f580-5c9c-9ccf-b3a48389f82a" :answer/id #uuid "f0f966f8-f580-5c9c-9ccf-b3a48389f82a"] ["answer-f0f966f8-f580-5c9c-9ccf-b3a48389f82a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f0f966f8-f580-5c9c-9ccf-b3a48389f82a" :answer/value "{S}_{xy}=1.12"] ["answer-e2058f1c-ca6b-5704-b24a-ad1af833dee9" :answer/id #uuid "e2058f1c-ca6b-5704-b24a-ad1af833dee9"] ["answer-e2058f1c-ca6b-5704-b24a-ad1af833dee9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e2058f1c-ca6b-5704-b24a-ad1af833dee9" :answer/value "{S}_{xy}=1.33"] ["answer-1f654eb5-da33-51e7-b9e3-237f2b57649d" :answer/id #uuid "1f654eb5-da33-51e7-b9e3-237f2b57649d"] ["answer-1f654eb5-da33-51e7-b9e3-237f2b57649d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-1f654eb5-da33-51e7-b9e3-237f2b57649d" :answer/value "{S}_{xy}=2.80"] ["answer-field-5b37bc23-4463-5cf2-acb2-e2f4162f0ffc" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-5b37bc23-4463-5cf2-acb2-e2f4162f0ffc" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-5b37bc23-4463-5cf2-acb2-e2f4162f0ffc" :answer-field/correct "answer-87b37972-f264-5fe7-be91-6532a22909a4"] ["answer-field-5b37bc23-4463-5cf2-acb2-e2f4162f0ffc" :answer-field/choices "answer-3a4e3e32-81eb-5215-b6e7-ca840cc59c2c"] ["answer-field-5b37bc23-4463-5cf2-acb2-e2f4162f0ffc" :answer-field/choices "answer-87b37972-f264-5fe7-be91-6532a22909a4"] ["answer-field-5b37bc23-4463-5cf2-acb2-e2f4162f0ffc" :answer-field/choices "answer-f0f966f8-f580-5c9c-9ccf-b3a48389f82a"] ["answer-field-5b37bc23-4463-5cf2-acb2-e2f4162f0ffc" :answer-field/choices "answer-e2058f1c-ca6b-5704-b24a-ad1af833dee9"] ["answer-field-5b37bc23-4463-5cf2-acb2-e2f4162f0ffc" :answer-field/choices "answer-1f654eb5-da33-51e7-b9e3-237f2b57649d"] ["question-e546cbd8-6c28-59cf-9108-41c070e316fd" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-5b37bc23-4463-5cf2-acb2-e2f4162f0ffc"] [17592186204008 :knowledge-point/questions "question-e546cbd8-6c28-59cf-9108-41c070e316fd"] [17592186204448 :question/problem "Consider two sets of $25$ paired observations ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{25},$ and ${y}_{1},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{25}.$ You are given that

