{{field-1}}."] [17592186204448 :question/worked-solution "Given a set of $n$ paired observations ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}$ and ${y}_{1},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{n},$ their covariance can be calculated as follows:

$$
\begin{aligned}Cov(x,y) & =\frac{{S}_{xy}}{n},\end{aligned}
$$

where ${S}_{xy}$ is the sum of products of the deviations of ${x}_{i}$ and ${y}_{i}$ from their means.

We are given that ${S}_{xy}=64.$ Substituting the given statistic in the above formula, we get

$$
\begin{aligned}Cov(x,y) & =\frac{64}{25} \\  & =2.56.\end{aligned}
$$"] [17592186204448 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-453923a5-93c8-5c6f-bfec-b6cdf2b78c6c" :answer/id #uuid "453923a5-93c8-5c6f-bfec-b6cdf2b78c6c"] ["answer-453923a5-93c8-5c6f-bfec-b6cdf2b78c6c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-453923a5-93c8-5c6f-bfec-b6cdf2b78c6c" :answer/value "2.56"] [17592186202614 :answer-field/correct "answer-453923a5-93c8-5c6f-bfec-b6cdf2b78c6c"] [17592186202614 :answer-field/choices "answer-453923a5-93c8-5c6f-bfec-b6cdf2b78c6c"] ["question-5cbb4944-93ba-5c18-a003-1720623144e5" :question/id #uuid "5cbb4944-93ba-5c18-a003-1720623144e5"] ["question-5cbb4944-93ba-5c18-a003-1720623144e5" :question/math-academy-id "q-251837"] ["question-5cbb4944-93ba-5c18-a003-1720623144e5" :question/problem "Consider two sets of $27$ paired observations ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{27},$ and ${y}_{1},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{27}.$ You are given that

$$
\begin{aligned} & {\sum }_{i=1}^{27}{x}_{i}=540,\,{\sum }_{i=1}^{27}{y}_{i}=567, \\  & {\sum }_{i=1}^{27}{x}_{i}^{2}=12\,050,\,{\sum }_{i=1}^{27}{y}_{i}^{2}=14\,107.\end{aligned}
$$

Calculate the sum of the squared deviations from the mean for the points ${x}_{i}.$

${S}_{xx}=$
{{field-1}}"] ["question-5cbb4944-93ba-5c18-a003-1720623144e5" :question/worked-solution "Given a set of $n$ paired observations ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}$ and ${y}_{1},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{n},$ the sum of squared deviations from the mean for the data ${x}_{i}$ can be calculated as follows:

$$
\begin{aligned}{S}_{xx} & ={\sum }_{i=1}^{n}({x}_{i}-\overset{―}{x})^{2} \\  & ={\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}^{2}-\frac{1}{n}{({\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i})}^{2}\end{aligned}
$$

Substituting the given statistics in the above formula, we get

$$
\begin{aligned}{S}_{xx} & =12\,050-\frac{1}{27}(540)^{2} \\  & =12\,050-10\,800 \\  & =1\,250.\end{aligned}
$$"] ["question-5cbb4944-93ba-5c18-a003-1720623144e5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-0ae99c74-d6dc-56f1-8e0e-a0b4df319323" :answer-field/id #uuid "0ae99c74-d6dc-56f1-8e0e-a0b4df319323"] ["answer-e22bc458-30f2-56c5-a752-2720115543c5" :answer/id #uuid "e22bc458-30f2-56c5-a752-2720115543c5"] ["answer-e22bc458-30f2-56c5-a752-2720115543c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e22bc458-30f2-56c5-a752-2720115543c5" :answer/value "1250"] ["answer-field-0ae99c74-d6dc-56f1-8e0e-a0b4df319323" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-0ae99c74-d6dc-56f1-8e0e-a0b4df319323" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-0ae99c74-d6dc-56f1-8e0e-a0b4df319323" :answer-field/correct "answer-e22bc458-30f2-56c5-a752-2720115543c5"] ["answer-field-0ae99c74-d6dc-56f1-8e0e-a0b4df319323" :answer-field/choices "answer-e22bc458-30f2-56c5-a752-2720115543c5"] ["question-5cbb4944-93ba-5c18-a003-1720623144e5" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-0ae99c74-d6dc-56f1-8e0e-a0b4df319323"] [17592186204010 :knowledge-point/questions "question-5cbb4944-93ba-5c18-a003-1720623144e5"] ["answer-field-b96494db-5dd2-5488-8cf6-d406dbf495a4" :answer-field/id #uuid "b96494db-5dd2-5488-8cf6-d406dbf495a4"] ["answer-38df4399-89bc-529e-b1a6-df9d281a088f" :answer/id #uuid "38df4399-89bc-529e-b1a6-df9d281a088f"] ["answer-38df4399-89bc-529e-b1a6-df9d281a088f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-38df4399-89bc-529e-b1a6-df9d281a088f" :answer/value "{S}_{xy}=21"] ["answer-9050f4d8-8c17-564c-9e1c-31ba36d7157b" :answer/id #uuid "9050f4d8-8c17-564c-9e1c-31ba36d7157b"] ["answer-9050f4d8-8c17-564c-9e1c-31ba36d7157b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9050f4d8-8c17-564c-9e1c-31ba36d7157b" :answer/value "{S}_{xy}=24"] ["answer-2032787c-d22e-592f-81df-10f4faf70894" :answer/id #uuid "2032787c-d22e-592f-81df-10f4faf70894"] ["answer-2032787c-d22e-592f-81df-10f4faf70894" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2032787c-d22e-592f-81df-10f4faf70894" :answer/value "{S}_{xy}=